<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Miweya</book>
  <para style="toc3">Yoa</para>
  <para style="toc2">YOANE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Yoane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bwɛndi Bopele bokoma Yoane</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOANE</para>
  <para style="imt">Bokwea ta buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta tei mɛndi mapele manɛi, bwɛndi bopele bo Yoane bodii botikoanake. Ebalakadea mɛnɛ na botikoana isolo di Monɔngɔ mo Yesu (ekenge enɛnɛ 18-19), edii oto na ba midjɔ bakɛkɛ bakuanakadea na mɛndi mapele makina. Ta mondumba mokina, Yoane adii oto iyo mɛnɛ moto obala masolo ondingo moki mo Kana ko na masaka ma Yesu na Nikodɛmɛ (3, 1-21), na mwali Mosamalia (4, 1-12), na moto o binama bikatatake o Betesaida (5, 1-18), na moto o miso mago donga ta bobotama (9, 1-41). Bwɛngɛ na mɛndi mapele makina, bwɛndi bopele bo Yoane bodii na midjɔ mikɛkɛ mi bomɔ bo Yesu iya ta kpɔtɔ. Enakoboa, abapakadea tɛtɔ enɛnɛ, banɛnɛ ta tei e bobo badii ndjea e bodia bileho bipa Yesu ta mbɛngɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta mbangi e yu (1, 1-18) ta mondumba mokomami imo bwɛndi bopele boinɛmedjakadea Yesu ondingo Mobalo mo Ndjakomba mokɔbili imua moimei moto ko modoi ahelama na bato, boɛnɛmɛ bo bomɔ, bohu ko na bosooti ta tei e bobo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta tei e bwɛndi bomina bodii bokabanake na bikenge binɛnɛnɛnɛ bibae binedjakadea «ehole» e Yesu, etingodjakadea bo ngonga e bogwa bo nde, edii pongono e boangɔdjɔmɔ bo nde ta ekumu (2, 4; 12, 23).</para>
  <para style="io1">Boso bo ehole e Yesu (1, 19-12, 50): ekenge iye e boso ebalakadea tati djinɛnɛ: Yoane Mobatisi, motingami o nde Andele, Pilipo, Natanaɛlɛ ibo basusu babala, moto na moto na ndenge ende, meko mibodjabo ta bomɔ bo Yesu. Ko bwɛndi bomina bopele botubanakadea masaka mitikoanake ma Yesu ko na midjɔ mi bokamodja sambo minedja iyo indingo «bimbete», ta boinedja ena bo edii oto bosipoa eka epalakadea iyo bobala. Yoane asidji ekenge iye e boso na boinedja mɛko misusu mikɔ iyo ko na bobala ta bokue bwɛndi bo Yesu (12, 37-50).</para>
  <para style="io1">Ndelo eimea ehole (13, 1), Yesu akinei batingami bilomu bi nde bi suka, olongo sia e bodhima (ekenge e nɛnɛ 13-16). Ta tei e boangɔnɔ, asɛlingoakadea boana na yogo ko api Sesa ibia badikadea ngɔngɔ dji nde (ekenge e nɛnɛ 17). Iboa ta botubana bo bopeama na botitedjama bo nde ta ikambo ko na yogo Yesu ta ekulusu, ko na boɛnɛmɛ bo ikila di bwase, Yoane ta midjɔ mi tɛtɔ mi mɛndi mapele makina (ekenge enɛnɛ 18-20). Busa bo Pasika boinedjamakadea na boɛnɛmɛ bo Yesu ta dii Malia o Magadala, ko ta dii batingami na bonɔɔ ta dii Toma. Ekenge e nɛnɛ 21 (batingami sambo, ta tei e bobo Petelo, basongana na Moto Osisoa ta bogwa ta mokula mo ibeke di Tibeliade) edii wɛtoko ekenge ebakeama ta suka e mokanda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Suka emina (20, 30-31) einedjakadea tina e bwɛndi bopele: boloma bato ibia bakalange bodhima Yesu Masiya o ndikano, Mwana o Ndjakomba. Naboa adiadea bomɔ, ta elɔkɔ edii sooti bo Yesu adii molomami o Sesa, edii oko mondumba mobalakadea iyo mɛnɛ bo, «ndjea, bosooti ko na bomɔ» (14, 6).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mobalo mo bohu ko na bomɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ta mbangi, Mobalo modaaka; ko Mobalo modaaka na Ndjakomba, ko Mobalo adaaka Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Mobalo modaaka na Ndjakomba donga mbangi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ molɔngɔ mo. 1-2 ko Bdj 8, 22-26.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Leka losusu lokɔɔ mɔ na Mobalo, ko pɛpɛ nongo eka emɔti edaa pɛpɛ bokɔmɔ na mu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ buku e Mba 1, 3; Ndj 33, 6.9; 1Ko 8, 6; 1Ko 1, 16-17. </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Ta tei e nde edaka bomɔ, ko bomɔ bodaaka bohu bo bato. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ko bohu bongɛsɛkɛdea andanda e modidi, endelo modidi moihɔnɔ bomodhima. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Ndjakomba aloma mwana o elomu omɔti, kombe e nde Yoane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii wɛtoko Yoane Mobatisi. Boindja 1, 19-36.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Iyo adoa ondingo temo, bɛngi atɔndee tati e bohu, bɛngi bo bato basusu badhime na ndjea ende. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yoane iyo mɛnɛ aidaka bohu, endelo adoa bɛngi adae tati e bohu. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Bohu bo mina bodaaka bosooti, ibua bodoa a ngondo ko boɛnɛmedjamakadea ta dii bato basusu. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Mobalo modaaka ta ngondo. Ko ngondo ekɔɔmɔ na Mu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja molɔngɔ mo 3. </char></note>, endelo ngondo eimodjeba. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Adua ta ekomi e nde iyo mɛnɛ, endelo bato ba nde baimoasɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Endelo ibia bamoasɔɔ ko bato bamodhimea, abapa bokondji bo boimeya bana ba Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Gal 3.26; 1 Yoa 3.1-2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ibo baimea bana ba Ndjakomba na ndjea e bobotama bo moto, na bopala bo moto, na posa e moto, endelo na posa e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Mobalo aimea moto, ko adaaka ta tei e biso, aluma na bwɛli ko na bosooti. Ko iso loɛnɛɛ ekumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 60, 1-2.</char></note> e nde, ekumu e Mwana o Ndjakomba omɔti edia iyo adi Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yoane akɔ tati ta tina e nde; aso adumbea bo: «Edi iyoo obalaka mbi bo: “Ngɔngɔ dji mbi moto omɔti adi bodoa endelo iyo anɔini, modjɔ mo iyo adaaka ehele boso bo mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1, 30.</char></note>.” » <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Iso lobolodja ibiso ibondo na bopele bonde; lobolodja bwɛli diko di bwɛli. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Mibeko midoa na Mose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 31, 18; 34, 28.</char></note>, endelo bwɛli ko bosooti djidoa na ndjea e Yesu Kilito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti oɛnɛ Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Boi 33, 20. </char></note>. Endelo Mwana o onde omɔti iyoo odi Ndjakomba, okadikame mbuti na Sesa, iyo mɛnɛ amohuodja ta dii iso.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tati e Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mal 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Indjani tati epama na Yoane ehole edoaka bakondji ba Bayudha ibiaba Yelusalɛmɛ ko baloma banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na ba lewi bɛngi bamowadje bo: «Wɛ odi nda?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Ailona bosɔmbedja, endelo adhima na bosooti bo: «Naditi Masiya.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bamowadja naikina bo: «Wɛ odii mɛnɛ nda? Wɛ Eliya?» – Yoane asɔmbedja: «Ngasa, mbi te Eliya.» – Bamowadja naikina bo: «Odi Motɛli?» Asɔmbedja bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mlk 3, 23; Dit 18.15, 18.</char></note>: «Pɛpɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Iboa bamobalea bo: «Wɛ odi mɛnɛ nda? Lotungi lokɛe asɔmbedja eyano tadi bato ibia balolomi. Obali tina e wɛ mɛnɛ bo?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yoane asɔmbedja bo: «Nadi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“moto odumbeakadea ta edhu bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">Ninodjani ndjea e Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 40.3, bolangama bobwana na mikanda miyou mi Bagɛlɛki.</char></note>!”»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">Ndenge etɔndɔ motɛli Isaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Tatei e bato ibia balomaka ibo, Bapalisai pongono badaaka. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Bamowadjaka na ikina bo: «Omiti da Masiya, kaoko Eliya, kao Motɛli, tina ebatisakadea na wɛ nda?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yoane abasɔmbedja bo: «Mbi, naobatisakadeani na madiba, endelo moto omɔti adi andanda e bino odaakadea ino pɛpɛ bomodjeba. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Moto omɔti adi bodoa ngɔngɔ dji mbi, ko nabwaniti botingoa mikpulu mi sapato dji nde.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Midjɔ mimina misusu minɔmɔkɔ ta Betania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betania: ngando e ibonga di pɛpɛ bodjebana ekadae ta pamba ekaimane modaakabusa ta Yɔlɔdane; pɛpɛ boɛngɛ na ngando edii na kombe emɔti ekadae mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ (boindja 11, 1).</char></note>, ta ngunda e Yɔlɔdane, ta esika edaka Yoane abatisa bato.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Mwana o bhata o Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Aya busa, Yoane aɛnɛ yo Yesu akɛkɛdeadoe adi iyo, aso adabala bo: «Indjani Mwana o bhata o Ndjakomba odongedjakadea pekato dji ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 53, 6-7.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Edii tina e nde ehole eotɔndeakani mbi bo: “Moto omɔti akakadoe ngɔngɔ dji mbi, endelo anoini na bokumu, modjɔ mo adaaka boso bo mbi”. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Mbi naidjebaka moto ndani okɔkɔ iyo da, endelo na doi abatisa bɛngi namodjebedje adii bana ba Isalɛlɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yoane adjebedja naikina bo: «Naɛni Mwembo botita ta busa ondingo embenga ko bodikama ta diko dinde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 11, 2; 61, 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Naidjebaka naikina kaoko adaaka ndani, endelo Ndjakomba, olomani bo nabatise na madiba, atɔndeani bo: “Iyo oɛnɛdea wɛ Mwembo botita ko boda diko dinde; edii yo moto obatisadea na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Mbi mɛnɛ naɛni modjɔ momina, ko nadhimedji bo moto iyoo adii Mwana o Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batingami ba boso ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Aya busa, Yoane adaaka naikina ta esika emina, na batingami bande babae ta tei e batingami. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Akokoledja Yesu ndelo edakaiyo akɛkɛ anɔe abala bo: «Indjani Mwana o bhata o Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1, 29.</char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Batingami babae ba Yoane aoka bo abala boa, bakimana Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu adumba mɛngɛ ngɔngɔ, aɛnɛ yo bo bamokimanakadea ko abawadja bo: «Ehombakadea ino nde?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Labi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Labi: kombe e monɔkɔ mo alameɛ.</char></note>, okadikame djɔ?» Kombe emina etingodji bo «Molehi». <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Doani ko oɛnɛdeani.» Iboa bakɛkɛ ko baɛnɛ esika ndani edaka yo, ko badaaka na nde busa itombo. Edaka ngonga e banɛi ngɔngɔ dji midi. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andele, mwange Simona Petelo, adaaka omɔti atei e bato babae baoka mɛko mi Yoane, ko bakimanaka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Moto o boso osongana na Andele edaka mwanango Simona; amotɔndea bo: «Iso losongani na Masiya.» Kombe emina etingodji bo «Kilito». <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ko akɛɛ na Simona ta dii Yesu. Yesu amokokoledja ko abala na nde bo: «Wɛ Simona, mwana moomi o Yoane; baobeabi; Sepasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sepasi: kombe e monɔkɔ mo alameɛ.</char></note>.» – Kombe emina einedji bo: «Ibanga».<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilipo na Natanaɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Aya busa, Yesu adaaka na mbuno e bokɛ ta Galileya. Asongana na Pilipo ko abala na nde bo: «Kimanani!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Pilipo adaaka moto o Betesaida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betesaida: ngando emɔti mbuti na Kapalanaume.</char></note>, ngando enɛnɛ iyena edonga Andele na Petelo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Pilipo asongana na Natanaɛlɛ ko abala na nde bo: «Iso lotanei iyona obala Mose tina ende ta buku e Mibeko ko iyona o bala batɛli pongono<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 18, 18; Isa 9, 5-6; Edj 34, 23.</char></note>. Edii Yesu o Nadjaleta, mwana moomi o Yosepu.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaɛlɛ amowadja bo: «Eka epele ndani ebwani boimana ta Nadjaleta?» Pilipo amosɔmbedja bo: «Doa ko oɛnɛdea.» <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yana aenɛ Yesu Natanaɛlɛ okɛkɛadoe ta dii yo, abala ta tina e nde bo: «Indjani Moisalɛlɛ omopele mɛnɛ, ta tei ende bokuta boditi.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaɛlɛ amowadja bo: «Wɛ odjebini ndenge nda?» Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Boso bo Pilipo aobee adaaki wɛ ta tina dji mole mo pigi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bobwana na mikanda mi balabe (balehi ba mibeko), bato badaaka na momɛsɛno mo bodaa nase dji mole mo pigi tina e bolanga ko boikoa Makomi.</char></note>, naonɛki.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Iboa Natanaɛlɛ abala na nde bo: «Molehi, odii Mwana o Ndjakomba, odii mokondji o Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 2, 7; Sop 3, 15. </char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Iboa, odhimeini modjɔmo nabali na wɛ bo ehole edaki wɛ ta nase dji mole mo pigi naonɛki? Djeba bo oɛnɛdea mɛko mikina minɛnɛ bonɔɔ imimi!» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ko Yesu abakea bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadea bo: oɛnɛdea busa bodipoamake ko bandjelu ba Ndjakomba boiwea ko botita diko di Mwana o moto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mba 28, 12. </char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tɛkɛ e moki ta Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu masato, tɛkɛ e moki edaka ta Kana, e Galileya. Ko nange e Yesu adaaka ena, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />ko babeaka pongono Yesu na batingami ba nde ta tɛkɛ emina e moki. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ta ehole emɔti iboa, vino esia. Nange Yesu amotɔndea bo: «Baditi na ikina na vino.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Endelo Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Mwali, edii wɛ moto otɔndeakadeani modjɔ mobwani mbi bokɔ? Ngonga e mbi epakinaimea.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Iboa nange e Yesu atɔndea basali bo: «Kɔɔni midjɔ misusu imi miotɔndeadeani iyo.» <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Mindungulu misamano mi mabanga midaaka ena na madiba tinae Bayudha ta momɛsɛno mo bobo mo bosasɛnodja. Momɔti ta tei e mu mokweaka litele mokama. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu abala na basali bo: «Lumedjani mindungulu na madiba.» Ko bamilumedja botɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Iboa Yesu abala na bu bo: «Edɛdiye bongani mboka ko pani na kapita o tɛkɛ.» Bakɔ oko iboa. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Kapita o tɛkɛ ameka madiba imi makindoa vino. Aidjebaka esika edongaka vino emina, endelo basali baloka madiba badjebaka. Abea moto osɔkɔ mwali <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ko abala na nde: «Moto mosusu akapɛ vino epele boso, ngɔngɔ djimina, bato bakalangoa, bakapɛ iyee e bopɛtɛpɛtɛ. Endelo wɛ, odedji vino epele mbunoko edɛdiyeye!» <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Iyena edaka, modjɔ mo bokamodja mo Yesu mo mbangi akɔɔ ta Kana, e Galileya; ainedja pongono ekumu e nde, ko batingami ba nde bamodhimea. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ngɔngɔ, akɛɛ ta Kapalanaumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 4, 13.</char></note> engbanga emɔti na nange e nde, bangibato ba nde ko na batingami ba nde. Badaa iho ba masu.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tei e Tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Tɛkɛ e Pasika e Bayudha eimeaka mbuti ko Yesu aiwea ta Yelusalɛmɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 12, 1-27.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ta Tepelo, Yesu atanea bato batɛkɛkɛ ngɔmbɛ, bhata ko na bimbenga, ko bato badaaka basɔmbɔtɔnɔ palanga pongono badii ta mesa djibobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 11, 15 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Iboa, akɔɔ mobalake na mikpulu ababengana ibo basusu ta Tepelo, na bhata ba bobo ko na ngɔmbɛ ba bobo, anangakaka palanga dji bato ibia basɔmbɔtɔnɔkɔ ko akukea mesa dji bobo; <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />ko atɔndea bato ba mimbongu mi bimbenga bo: «Dongedjani leka lo bino losusu iya! Pɛ bohombedjani ndako e Sesa ndako e mombongu!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Batingami bande balɛnɛkɛ na mɛko imimi mikomamaka ta Makomi bo: «Ah Ndjakomba, epaeli e mbi tinae ndako e wɛ, eangodjadeani molema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 69, 10.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Iboa bakondji ba Bayudha bamowadja bo: «Embete e bokamodja ekɔdea wɛ nda bɛngi oloinedje bo odii na bokondji bo bokɔ mɛko imi?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Bukani Tepelo iye, ko ngɔngɔ dji masu masato naetongadea naikina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 26, 61; 27, 40; Mal 14, 58; 15, 29.</char></note>.» – <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Bayudha bamosɔmbedja bo: «Tepelo iyeye baetonga bianga tuku inɛi na basamano, ko wɛ, oetongadea naikina na masu masato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Botongama bo bokina bo tepelo bobangaka ta yanga e 20 boso bo Yesu bobotama, ta ehole e bokondji bo Elode o Monɛnɛ.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Endelo tepelo ebalaka Yesu, edaaka wɛtoko mokuku mo nde. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ngɔngɔ dji mina, ehole esisoa Yesu ta bogwa, batingami ba nde balɛnɛ mɛko mibalaka iyo; ko badhimea Ikomi ko na mɛko mibalaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akadjebe na bonɔ molema mo moto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ehole edaaka Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ta eyenga e Pasika, bato banɛnɛ bamodhimea naboɛnɛ midjɔ mi bokamoa mikɔkɔ yo. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Endelo Yesu aibaisaka molema, modjɔ mo abadjebaka ibo basusu bopele mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Yesu aidaka na tina e bo bamotɔndee mɛko mi bato, modjɔ mo adjebaka eka esusu edii ta tei e molema mo moto.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Nikodɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Edaka na moto omɔti kombe e nde Nikodɛmɛ, iyo odaaka ta iputo di Bapalisai ko iyo adaaka omɔti o bakondji ba Bayudha.<verse eid="JHN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Adoa na bulu adii Yesu ko abala na nde bo: «Molehi, lodjebakadea bo Ndjakomba aoloma bɛngi ololwɛe bileho; modjɔ mo moto omɔti abwaniti bokɔ bimbete dji bokamoa mondumba mokɔkɔdea wɛ Ndjakomba amiti daa na nde.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Sooti mɛɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadea bo: moto abwaniti boɛnɛ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba amiti botama naikina.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodɛmɛ amowadja bo: «Ndenge ndani moto mopingamake abwani abotama naikina? Ndenge ndani ebwani na nde bosɔmbɔ ta sɔpɔ dji nango bɛngi abotame mbala ebabae?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadea bo: moto amiti botama na madiba ko na Mwembo atakwea ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Eka ebotami na mini edii mini; ko eka ebotami na Mwembo edii mwembo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Pɛpɛ bokamwa tina e bo nabali nawɛ bo: “Etungi na nu bobotama naikina.” <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mopɛpɛ mokakɔe pamba djisusu djikapale mo; okaoke ngilimo dji mu, endelo todjebe nongo pamba edongi mo kaoko pamba ekɛkɛdea imo. Indja eka ekakɔme adii iyona obwani bobotama na Mwembo mo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodɛmɛ amowadja naikina bo: «Modjɔ momina mobwani bokɔmɔ mondumba nda?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu amosɔmbedji bo: «Wɛ moto odii molehi o djebami ta Isalɛlɛ, otasipoakadea midjɔ mimina? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadea bo: lobalakadea mɛko imii midjebadea iso, ko lobalakadea tati e midjɔ imia miɛnɛ iso, endelo otapalakadeani bodhima tati e biso. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Omiti dhimani ehole e babalakadea mbi na nu mɛko mi kpɔtɔ, ndenge ndani edhimabini na nu nakabala mɛko mi busa? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti oiwea ta busa, dongedja oko Mwana o moto iyoo otita ta busa! <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Oko ndenge emangɔdjɔ Mose ekeko e ndjɔ ta edhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mits 21, 9. </char></note>, etungi na Mwana o moto angɔdjɔme oko mondumba momina momɔti, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />bɛngi bo iyona obwani bomodhimea adie bomɔ bo kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Modjɔ mo Ndjakomba apala ngondo na bonɔ aso apa Mwana onde omɔti, bɛngi bo iyona obwani bomodhimea adae pɛpɛ bobeha endelo adie bomɔ bo kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ndjakomba ailoma Mwana onde ta ngondo bɛngi bo aesambedje, endelo bɛngi ngondo ehele na ndjea ende. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Iyona omodhimei aditi mosambedjamake; ekahia iyona odai pɛpɛ bodhima asi bosambedjama ehele, modjɔ mo aidhima Mwana omɔti o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Indja mondumba mokɔmɔbi sambi emina: bohu bodoi ta ngondo, ko bato bapala modidi bonɔ bohu, modjɔ mo mikɔ mi bobo midii mibe. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Iyona okakɔe bobe akalone bohu, modjɔ mo akabange midjɔ mi nde mibe misaka imana ta bohu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Endelo iyona okakɔe bosooti akaimane ta bohu, bɛngi bo baɛnɛ sooti bo mikɔ mi nde mibwani na bolulea bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Yoane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu akɛɛ na batingami bande ta Yudhea. Iho adikamaka nabu baa masu, ko abatisaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 4, 1-2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yoane pongono abatisaka, ta Enoni mbuti na Salimi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enoni na Salimi: ngando djibae dji mbuti na ibɛngɛ di Yɔlɔdane.</char></note>, modjɔ mo iho madiba madaaka manɛnɛ. Bato bakɛkɛ ta dii iyo ko ababatisaka. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Modjɔ mo, Yoane aipetaka isama ta bɔlɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 14, 3; Mal 6, 17; Luk 3, 19-20.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Enakoboa, ndambo emɔti e batingami ba Yoane batubana na Moyudha omɔti ta momɛsɛno mo bobo mo bosasɛnodja. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bakɛɛ atanea Yoane ko bamotɔndea bo: «Molehi, obwani bodjeba moto iyona odaki nawɛ ta ngunda ekina e Yɔlɔdane, iyona otɔndɔkɔbi wɛ tati ende? Edɛdie koko, iyo abatisakadea ko bato basusu bakɛkɛdea amoindja!» <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yoane abasombedja bo: «Moto omɔti abwaniti bokɔɔ eka emɔti emiti daa Ndjakomba amopɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Ino bɛnɛ obwani bobala tati bo nabala bo: “Mbi naditi Masiya, endelo nalomama boso bonde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mal 3, 1.</char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Iyo odii ondingo moomi iyona obolodji mwali; endelo mwange moomi akadae seko mbuti na nde ko amohokamedja, iyo akadae seko na mongandi mo booka kɔpi e moomi. Mongandi modii wɛteko mo mbi, ko edɛdiyeye modii mosusu. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Etungi gala e nde enangane, ko e mbi etite.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyona odongi ta busa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />«Moto iyo adongi ta busa anɔi basusu; iyo odii ta kpɔtɔ adii o kpɔtɔ ko akabale midjɔ mi kpɔtɔ. Iyo adongi ta busa [adii ta diko di bato basusu]; <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />abalakadea tati e midjɔ miɛnɛ iyo ko mioka iyo ko pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti odhima tati e nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Iyo oasɔi tati e nde, adhimedji bo Ndjakomba akabale sooti. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Iyo oloma Ndjakomba akabale mɛko mi Ndjakomba, modjɔ mo Ndjakomba amolumedja na Mwembo mo nde mosusu. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Sange moto apala Mwana ko apa misusu amɔmɔ ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Iyo odhimei Mwana adii na bomɔ bo kɔbili; iyona odai pɛpɛ bodhimea Mwana adiiti na bomɔ bomina, endelo kɛlɛ e Ndjakomba edaabi ta diko di nde.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na mwali Mosamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yesu aoka Bapalisai batubana bo iyo adiaka ko abatisaka batingami banɛnɛ bonɔ Yoane. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ta bosooti, Yesu iyo mɛnɛ aibatisa nongo moto omɔti, edaka wɛtoko batingami bande bato babatisaka. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Iboa Yesu akina Yudhea ko asɔmbɔ ta Galileya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Enakoboa bɛngi akɛe ta Galileya, abwanaka anɔe ta Samalia. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Aimea mbuti na ngando emɔti e Samalia kombe eyu Sikale, mbuti na gbie epa Yakobo na mwana o nde Yosepu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mba 33, 19; Yos 24, 32.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Iyana edaka na ibulu di madiba di Yakobo. Yesu, moɛmbɛke na mɔɔngɔ, adaaka na mobondo mbuti na ibulu. Edaka bokimana ngonga e basamano. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mwali omɔti o Samalia adoa aloka madiba ko Yesu abala na nde: «Pani madiba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Batingami bande bakɛkɛ a ngando enɛnɛ asomba mia ma boyaka. – <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mwali mosamalia abala na Yesu bo: «Endelo, wɛ odi Moyudha! Ndenge ndani, obwani bowadja ni madiba ma bomwaka, mbi iyoo odi, Mosamalia?» – Modjɔ mo, Bayudha tebaokane na Basamalia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Luk 9, 52-53. </char></note>. – <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Osoodjeba ikabo dikapɛ Ndjakomba, ko eka edii moto iyoo osaosɛngɛ madiba ma bomwaka, ka wɛ moto okɔki mowadja madiba ko abwanaki aopɛ madiba ma bomɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mwali amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, oditi na egbogolo ko ibulu dinɔi mbɛngɛ. Abolodjadea wɛ madiba mamina ma bomɔ djɔ? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Kɔkɔ o biso Yakobo alopa ibulu idii; iyo mɛnɛ amwaka pongono madiba imi, bana ba nde na tito ba bobo bamwaka pongono madiba imi. Wɛ opalakadea onɔe Yakobo?» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Iyona obwani bomwaka madiba imi aokadea naikina posa e madiba; <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />endelo iyo omwakadea madiba imi ma mopadea mbi, ataokabi posa e madiba: madiba mamopadea mbi maimeadea adii iyo elokeli bomɔ bokɔbili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 12, 3; Yil 2, 13; 17, 13.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mwali abala nande: «Kumu, pani madiba mamina imia, bɛngi nadae pɛpɛ booka posa e madiba naikina ko nadae naikina pɛpɛ bodoa aloka madiba iya.» <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu abala nande bo: «Kɛɛ bea muma wɛ ko sɔmbɔ iya.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mwali amosɔmbedja bo: «Naditi na moomi.» Ko Yesu abala na nde: «Odii na elonga ebobala bo oditi na moomi; <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />modjɔ mo odia bami batano, ko iyona odi nawɛ edɛdiye iye aditi muma wɛ. Obali sooti.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Iboa mwali abala na nde: «Kumu naɛnɛkɛdea bo wɛ odii motɛli. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Bakɔkɔ ba biso ba Basamalia bakumea Ndjakomba iya ta ngomba iye, endelo ino Bayudha, obalakadeani bo esika ebwani na bomokumea edii ta Yelusalɛmɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boimana ta iputo di Bayudha, Basamalia batonga tepelo emɔti ta ngomba e Galidjime, ngomba e mbuti na Sikɛmɛ eyou. Ta Yelusalɛmɛ: Boɛngɛ Ndj 122, 1-4.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Dhimeani, ehole ekɛkɛ adoe otakumeadeani Sesa iya ta ngomba iye, na nongo ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Ino, Basamalia, okakumeeni Ndjakomba na pɛ bomodjeba; iso, Bayudha, lokamokumee ko lokamodjebe, modjɔ mo mohelo modongi ta dii Bayudha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 2, 3; Lom 9, 3-4.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Endelo ehole eimeadea, ko esi boimea ehele, iye bakumei ba sooti mɛnɛ bakumeadea Sesa na Mwembo ko na bosooti; modjɔ mo ibo badii ibia bakapale Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ndjakomba adi Mwembo, ko ibia bamokumeakadea etungi bamokumee na Mwembo ko na bosooti.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mwali abala na nde bo: «Nadjebakadea bo Masiya epali bobala bo Kilito akɛkɛdea adoe. Ehole edoadea iyo, alotingodjadea midjɔ misusu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Edii mbi, moto iyona obalakadea na wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Ta ehole emina, batingami ba Yesu baimea; ko bakamo amoɛnɛ bo asoola na mwali. Endelo pɛ nongo omɔti o bobo omowadja bo: «Ehombakadea wɛ nde?» kaoko: «Eka esolakadea wɛ nande nda?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Iboa mwali akina mondungulu mo nde, ko asɔmbɔ ta ngando enɛnɛ, iho abala na bato: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Doaindjeni Moto omɔti adii bobo abali na mbi mɛko misusu mikɔɔ mbi. Edadea ndelo ekina Masiya?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Baimana ta ngando enɛnɛ bakɛɛ adii Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ta ehole emina, batingami baɔngɔnɔkɔ Yesu ko babalaka bo: «Molehi, yaka!» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Endelo abasɔmbedja bo: «Mbi nadii na miya ma boya imi madaaka ino pɛpɛ bodjeba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Batingami basawadjana bo: «Emolwɛki moto omɔti mia ma boyaka?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu abala nabu bo: «Mia ma mbi, edii wɛtoko bosuma bolulea bo moto olomani ko bosidja mosala mopani iyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Ino okabaleni bo: “Ediki naikina na songe banɛi bɛngi ehole ebotsoa mbuma eimee.” Endelo mbi nabali na nu, indjani gbie bopele: mbuma dji dii djipingake ko dji dii mbuti na bodjitsoa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Iyona okatsoɛ akabolodje iputi di nde ko akaputoanedje mbuma tina e bomɔ bo kɔbili; na boa, moto okaone na moto akatsoɛ bakasepe engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Natina emina edii sooti na isese dia dibala: “Omɔti aoni ko okina atsui.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Mbi, naolomini atsoa ta gbie iyena edaa ino pɛpɛ bosala; bakina basala ko ino, oimeini atina e botsoa mbuma dji mosala mo bobo.» <verse eid="JHN 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Basamalia banɛnɛ ba ngando enɛnɛ emina badhimea Yesu modjɔ mo mwali iyona abala bo: «Abali na mbi misusu mikɔɔ mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Na tina emina, ehole edoa Basamalia mbuti na Yesu, bamowadja bɛngi adikame na bu; ko iyo adikama ena masu mabae. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Badaa naikina banɛnɛ mɛnɛ abodhimea, ta tina e midjɔ minɛnɛ mibalaka iyo; <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />ko babalaka na mwali bo: «Edɛdiye iso lodhimiti oto eloke midjɔ milotɔdeaki wɛ, endelo modjɔ mo iso bɛnɛ lomooki, ko lodjebakadea bo adii sooti mɛnɛ Moheledji o ngondo.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Modjɔ mo bokamoa mo babae ta Kanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu mamina mabae ta esika emina, Yesu adonga ena ko akɛɛ ta Galileya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Modjɔ mo Yesu iyo mɛnɛ abala bo: «Motɛli takume ta ngando ende<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 13, 57; Mal 6, 4; Luk 4, 24.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Endelo ehole eimea iyo ta Galileya, bato ba Galileya bamoasɔɔ bopele mɛnɛ, modjɔ mo ibo pongono bakɛkɛ ta tɛkɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 2, 23.</char></note> e Pasika ta Yelusalɛmɛ baɛnɛkɛ midjɔ misusu imimi mikɔkɔ iyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Iboa Yesu ahula ta Kanana e Galileya, iho a esika ekindodja madiba vino. Iyana edaka na mosali omɔti o basoda ba mokondji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokindodja madiba vino: boindja 2, 1-11. Mosali o basoda ba mokondji: kombe e monɔkɔ mo Bagɛlɛki etingodjakadea bo moto omɔti oisami ta mosala mo «mokondji» Elode Atipasi. </char></note>, adaaka na mwana moomi na epeko ta Kapalanaume. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Iyana aoka yo bo Yesu aimei ta Yudhea bɛngi akɛe ta Galileya, akɛɛ adii iyo ko amoɔngɔnɔ bɛngi bakɛe ta Kapalanaume aheledja mwana moomi o nde, odaaka mbuti na bogwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Omiti ɛnɛ bimbete bi bokamodja ko na bingengo otadhimadea!» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Mosali o basoda amosɔmbedja bo: «Molehi, doa tadii mbi boso bo mwana ombi bogwa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Yana! mwana o wɛ aheli.» Moto omina adhima mɛko mi motɔndeaka Yesu ko ayana. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ta iyane di nde na ndjea, basali ba nde badoa asongana na nde ko bamotɔndea bo: «Mwana o wɛ aheli!» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Iyo abawadja ngonga ndani ebanga mwana boka bopele, ko bamosɔmbedja bo: «Pɛpɛlɛ e nde esiaki mɔkɔ ta ngonga e boso ngɔngɔ dji midi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Sange mwana adjebaka bo edaka oko ngonga emaka motɔndea Yesu bo: «Mwana o wɛ aheli.» Iboa adhimea Yesu na denga di nde disusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 11, 14; 16, 14-15.31.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Iyena edaka embete e babae ekɔɔ Yesu, ngɔngɔ dji ihule di nde ta Yudhea bɛngi akɛe ta Galileya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2, 11.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o biama bikakatake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu akɛɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta tɛkɛ emɔti e Bayudha. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ta ngando enɛnɛ emina, mbuti na modipe mo Bhata edaaka na, ediba emɔti ko na mbalasani djitano; ekabeame na monɔkɔ mo Baebele Betesaida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betesaida: ta mikanda mikina Betesida.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ta mbalasani djimina, emumu e bato ba bipeko badaaka basambi ena: bato ba miso mago, bitumbɛ, bato ba binama bikatatake. [Bambaka madiba makumane; <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />modjɔ mo andjelu o Kumu atitaka bihole bikina ta ediba ko akumanedjaka madiba. Mokɔni o boso atiteika ta madiba ehole e kumani mo, ahelaka na epeko ende, na yogo emina edae e mondumba ndani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ imua modii ta tei e kolosɛ (ta suka e molɔngɔ 3 ko 4) modiiti ta mikanda mikina minɛnɛ miyou.</char></note>.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Ta tei e bobo moto omɔti o epeko adaaka ena akɔɔ na epeko ende bianga tuku isato na bomwambe. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Ehole emoɛnɛ Yesu asambi ta kpɔtɔ ko, aoka bo ayeyoa na epeko masu manɛnɛ, amowadja bo: «Opalakadea ohele?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Moto o epeko amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, mbi naditi na moto o bodumbani ta ediba ta ehole ekakumane madiba; ndelo ahombi mbi bɛngi natitea ta ediba, moto okina asi botitea boso bo mbi ehele.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Saangɔdjɔ, tomba itɔkɔ di wɛ ko dala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Na mbala emɔti, moto omina ahela; atomba itɔkɔ di nde ko abanga bodala. Enakoboa, modjɔ momina monɔɔmɔkɔ ta busa bo sabata, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />ko bakondji ba Bayudha babala na moto iyona ohela bo: «Edii busa bo sabata, odiiti na enɔli e boandoa itɔkɔ di wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Yil 17, 21; Nem 13, 19.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Abasɔmbedja bo: «Moto iyo oheledjini abali na mbi bo: “Andoa itɔkɔ di wɛ ko dala.”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Iboa bamowadja bo: «Moto omina nda iyo obali na wɛ bo: “Andoa itɔkɔ di wɛ ko dala”?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Endelo moto iyoo ohelaka aidjebaka, modjɔ mo Yesu adimoaka ta emumu e bato edaka ta esika emina. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu asongana na nde ta tepelo ko amotɔndea bo: «Indja edɛdiyeye wɛ iyona osa bolodja mohelo, Pɛ bokɔko pekato naikina, bɛngi bo eka emɔti ebe edae pɛ bootanea.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Moto omina akɛɛ atɔndea bakondji ba Bayudha bo edaka Yesu moto omoheledja. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Natina emina, Bayudha babanga bohomba bonɔngedja Yesu, modjɔ mo akɔkɔ modjɔ momina ta busa bo sabata. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Endelo Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Sange mbi akasale ehole esusu ko mbi nakasale oko ondingo iyo.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ta tina e mobalo momina, bakondji ba Bayudha bahombaka naikina na ngulu mwɛngi mo bowa Yesu; modjɔ mo aisukea oto na bokotoa sabata, endelo abalaka naikina bo Ndjakomba adii Sange nde mɛnɛ ko na mondumba momina asaɛngɛkɛ na Ndjakomba.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpati e mwana o Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu asɔmbɔ naikina bobala bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeini bo: Mwana abwaniti bokɔ eka emɔti oto na nde iyo mɛnɛ; ebwani bokɔ seko modjɔ moɛnɛkɛdea iyo Sango akɔ. Modjɔ mosusu mokakɔe Sange moto Mwana akakɔe oko iboa. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Modjɔ mo sange moto akapale Mwana ko amoinedji midjɔ misusu mikakɔe iyo mɛnɛ. Amoinedjadea na ikina midjɔ minɛnɛnɛ bonɔ imimi bo okamoadeani. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Modjɔ mo, oko ndenge emɔti esisodjakadea Sesa bato bago ko bobapa bomɔ, oko iboa Mwana pongono apakadea bomɔ adi iyona opali iyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ko Sesa tasambedjake moto, endelo apana enɔli e bosambedja misusu adii Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />bɛngi bo bato basusu bakumedje Mwana oko mondumba mokumedjakadea ibo Sange moto. Iyona odaakadea pɛ bokumedja Mwana, atakumedjakadea Sange moto iyoo omoloma. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeini bo: iyona obwani booka mobalo mo mbi, ko akadhime iyoo olomani, adii na bomɔ bo kɔbili. Atanɔbi ta sambi, endelo anɔɔ yogo ehele ko asɔmbɔ ta bomɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadeani bo: ehole ekɛkɛadoe, ko eimei mbuti, iyee eokadea bato bago, kɔpi e Mwana o Ndjakomba ko ibia bamookabi baheladea. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Modjɔ mo, Sesa iyo mɛnɛ adii molo mo ediba mo bomɔ oko mondumba momɔti apa Mwana adae molo mo ediba e bomɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Ko apa Mwana bokondji bo bosambedja, modjɔ mo adii Mwana o moto. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Pɛpɛ bomokamwadeani oko, modjɔ mo ehole ekɛkɛdea adoe bato bago basusu badii ta mimbɔndɔ mi makila baokadea kɔpi ende <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />ko baimanadea ta makila ma bobo. Ibia bakɔ bopele basisoadea ta bogwa bɛngi badie bomɔ, endelo ibia bakɔɔ bobe basisoadea bɛngi basambe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Dan 12, 2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Nabwaniti bokɔ eka mbi mɛnɛ: Nakasambedje ngɔngɔ dji eka ekabaleeni ibo, ko bosambedja bo mbi bodii na bosooti modjɔ mo natahombakadea bokɔ bopala bo mbi mɛnɛ, endelo bopala bo iyona olomani.»<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tati epaama ta tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />«Ekada mbi nabali tati tina e mbi mɛnɛ, tati e mbi etadadea sooti. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Endelo edii wɛteko okina moto abale tati tina e mbi ko nadjebakadea bo tati iyena edii tina e mbi edii sooti. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Ino olomani bato ta dii Yoane, ko iyo abala tati ta bosooti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii ta tina e Yoane Mobatisi. Boindja 1, 19-27; 3, 22-30.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Nitakambakadea na tati e moto; endelo nabalakadea modjɔ momina oto bɛngi ino odaeni bahelake. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yoane adaaka molinda imumu mobwanedjama bɛngi moenɛmedje ko ino bɛɛnɛ opalakani bosepa ehole ekɛkɛ na bohu bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Endelo adii mbi nadii na tati enɔi enɛnɛ bonɔ iyena e Yoane: mikɔ mokɔkɔdea mbi, edii oko imia mipani Sesa bɛngi bo namikokedje, minedjakadea tati e mbi ko minedjakadea bo Sesa alomani. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Ko Sesa iyoo mɛnɛ olomani abalakadea tati ta tina e mbi. Ino, opakinaokani moholi mo nde ko opakinaenɛni mbanda e nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Otabaneakadeani mibalo mi nde Ta tei e bino, modjɔ mo otadhimeakadeani iyona oloma iyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ino oikoakadeani Makomi bopele modjɔ mo olɛdjɛkɛdeani bo odiadeani na mu bomɔ bo kɔbili: enakoboa Makomi mamina imo mɛnɛ mabalakadea tati ta tina e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1, 45 ko na nase.</char></note>! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Tina emina, otapalakadeani bodoa ta dii mbi bɛngi bo odieni bomɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />«Mbi nitahombakadea ekumu ta dii bato. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Endelo mbi: nadjebakadea bo ta tei e bino oditini na bwela ta dii Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Mbi nadoa ta tina e kombe e Sange mbi, ko ino olonakadeani boasɔnini. Endelo moto okina akadoa na kombe ende iyo mɛnɛ ena, omosɔɔdeani! <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ino opalini bodia ekumu ta dii bina nu ko otahombakadeani bodia ekumu ekadonge ta dii Ndjakomba iyo mɛnɛ; mondumba ndani mobwani na nu bodhimeanini? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Pɛpɛ bolɛdjɛdeani oko bo naopundandeani ta dii Sesa. Edii Mose moto opundadeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 31, 26-27.</char></note>, iyo moto oisa ino elɛndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Osodhimeani mɛnɛ Mose okɔki dhimeani mbi pongono modjɔ mo iyo akoma ta tina e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 18, 15.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Endelo ta mɛti na bo otadhimakadeani eka ekoma iyo, ndenge ndani edhimadea na nu mibalo mi mbi?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayedji baami koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mal 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu akɛɛ ta ngunda ekina e ibeke e Galileya bakaebee pongono ibeke di Tibeliade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii kombe ekina e Ibeke di Galileya etungi ebeame boa ta ngando enɛnɛ e Tibeliade (Boindja 6, 23) edaka ta mokula mo ibeke dɔɔngɔ di kasame modaakabusa.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Emumu e bato banɛnɛ bamokimanaka, modjɔ mo baɛnɛkɛ bimbete bi bokamodja bikɔkɔ iyo ta boheledja bato ba bego. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu aiwea ta diko di ngomba adaa ena na mobondo na batingami bande. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Enakoboa Pasika, tɛkɛ e bayuda, eimeaka mbuti. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu aindja ko aso aɛnɛ emumu e bato banɛnɛ badoaka ta dii iyo; awadja Pilipo bo: «Abwani iso bosomba mapa djɔ bɛngi lobapɛ ibo basusu bayake?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Abalaka iboa tina e bomeka Pilipo, modjɔ mo iyo adjebaka eka ndani ebwanadea iyo bokɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Pilipo amosɔmbedja bo: «Nongo na pata djipalanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pata dji palanga: boindja Mal 6, 37 et ko nase.</char></note> mikama mibae, lotasombadea mapa manɛnɛ bengi bo omɔti omɔti o bobo abolodje nongo mo ekenge.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Omɔti o batingami bande, Andele, mwange Simona Petelo, abala na nde bo: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Iya edii na mwana moomi amɔti adii na mapa matano makɔɔmɔ na mbuma e ɔlɔdje ko na swi babae. Endelo ebwani bokɔ bato ibi banɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2 Bak 4, 42-44. </char></note> na mu nde?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu abala bo: «Dedjani bato basusu na mbondo.» Ndjani djinɛnɛ djidaka ta esika emina. Iboa baso badaa na mbondo; baami mbuti na koto itano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Iboa, Yesu atomba mapa ko, ngɔngɔ dji bosakoa Ndjakomba, amakabana na bato ibibia badaaka ena. Abapa pongono swi oko modumba momina, ta ndenge epalaka ibo. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ehole eyaka ibo basusu na ndja e bobo, Yesu abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Andoani bikenge ibi bidiki, bɛngi bo eka emɔti edae pɛpɛ bonama.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ba djiandoana ko balumedja mitinga doomi na mibae na bikenge dji mapa matano makɔɔmɔ na mbuma e ɔlɔdje madikaka ta imia mayaka ibo. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ehole eɛnɛ bato bimbete bibokamodja bikɔkɔ Yesu, babala bo: «Moto iyo adi mɛnɛ Motɛli iyo osadoa ta ngondo!» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Endelo Yesu adjeba bo baduadea amotomba na ngulu bɛngi bamopɛ bokondji. Iboa, asatuba na ikina yo mɛnɛ, ta ngomba.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali diko di madiba</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 14:22-27">Mat 14, 22-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mal 6, 45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Yana aimea busa mɔkɔmɔkɔ, batingami ba Yesu batitea ta mokula mo ibeke, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />batitea ta bwato bomɔti ko babanga bokatisa ta dɔɔngɔ di Kapalanaume. Busa bosiaka bodipa ko Yesu aipetaka imia dɔɔngɔ didaka ibo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Madiba ma ibeke makumana, modjɔ mo mopɛpɛ mobomaka na ngulu. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Batingami balukaka bohali bo kilomɛtɛlɛ djitano kaoko djisamano ehole eɛnɛ bo Yesu bobatama mbuti na bwato akɛkɛ adale ta diko di madiba; ko baso baluma na bɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Endelo Yesu abala na bu bo: «Edii mbi, pɛpɛ bobangani!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Batingami bahombaka bamotitedje ta bwato, endelo na mbala emɔti bwato bosɛmɛɛ, ta polo ekɛkɛ bo.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emumu e bato ehombi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Iyana aya busa, emumu e bato badikaka ngunda ekina e ibeke badjeba bo edaka ena oto na bwato bomɔti; bato baso badjeba bo Yesu aititeaka ta bwato bomina botitea batingami ba nde, endelo batingami bakɛkɛ ibo bɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Naboa, makina maato, imia madonga ta ngando enɛnɛ e Tibeliade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 6, 1 ko na nase.</char></note>, maimeaka mbuti na esika eyakaka bo mapa ngɔngɔ dji Kumu bosakoa Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ehole eɛnɛ bato bo Yesu na batingami ba nde baidaka ena, batitea ta maato ma mina ko bakɛɛ ta Kapalanaumu ahombe Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mapa ma bomɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Batanea Yesu ta ngunda ekina e ibeke ko baso babala na nde bo: «Molehi, oimeaki djɔno ehole nda?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani, sooti mɛnɛ bo: otahombakadeanini modjɔ mo oɛnini bimbete bi bokamodja bikɔki mbi, endelo modjɔ mo ayakabini mapa ko ogolabini. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Kinani bosalani oto ta tina e mia imia makabehe, endelo tina e miya imia makayeyoe ko imia madii molo mo edhiba e bomɔ bo kɔbili. Mia mamina Mwana o moto aopabini, modjɔ mo Ndjakomba, Sango, amoisa embete e bokondji bo nde.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Iboa bamowadja bo: «Ebwani iso bokɔ nde bɛngi lokokedje mikɔ mi Ndjakomba?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Mosala mopalakadea Ndjakomba tina e bino, modii bo odhimeeni iyo oloma iyo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Bamowadja bo: «Endelo wɛ modjɔ mo bokamodja ndani mobwani wɛ bolokɔmea bɛngi bo iso lodhimee? Mosala ndani mokɔdea wɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Bakɔkɔ ba biso bayakaka mana ta edhu, mondumba mobalakadea Makomi bo: “Abapa mapa ma boyaka imi madonga ta busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 16, 4.15; Ndj 78, 24. </char></note>.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakadeani sooti bo: editi Mose moto oopani mapa ma busa, endelo edii Sange e mbi moto opakadeani mapa ma sooti mɛnɛ ma busa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Modjɔ mo mapa makapɛ Ndjakomba, edii wɛtoko iyona odongi ta busa ko opakadea bomɔ ta ngondo» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Iboa, babala na nde bo: «Kumu, lopa masu masusu mapa ma mina imia.» <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Mbi nadii mapa ma bomɔ. Iyona odoi ta dii mbi ataokabi ndja ko iyona odhimeni, atadaabi na posa e madiba. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Endelo nabala na nu modjɔ momina bo: oɛnɛnini ko otadimakadeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 20, 29.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Moto mosusu opini Sesa aduabi ta dii mbi, ko iyona odoi ta dii mbi, natamodumbabi sokolu; <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />modjɔ mo naidonga ta busa tina e bokɔɔ bopala bo mbi, endelo tina e bokɔɔ bopala bo iyona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Enakoboa indja bopala bo iyona olomani: edii bo nadae pɛ bobungedja nongo omɔti obia bapani yo, endelo na basɔmbedje ta bomɔ ta busa bo suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Bopala bo Sange mbi mɛnɛ, bodii bo: ibia basusu baɛni Mwana ko bomodhimea badiadea bomɔ bo kɔbili ko mbi na basɔmbedjebi ta bomɔ ta busa bo suka.» <verse eid="JHN 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Bayudha banungubanaka na nde modjɔ mo iyo abalaka bo: «Edii mbi moto odii mapa imimi madonga ta busa.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Basawadjaka bo: «Iyo te Yesu, mwana o Yosepu? Lodjebakadea sango na nango<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mal 6, 3; Mat 13, 55; Luk 4, 22. </char></note>. Ndenge ndani ebwani iyo bobala edɛdiyeye bo: “Edii mbi moto odii mapa imi madonga ta busa”?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Kinani bonungubana ta tei e bino. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Moto abwaniti bodoa ta dii mbi emiti daa bo Sesa iyo olomani amobee, ko mbi, namosɔmbedjabi ta bomɔ ta busa bo suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Indja ndenge ekomama ta mikanda mi Batɛli: “Ibo basusu balehamabi na Ndjakomba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Isa 54, 13. </char></note> Moto mosusu iyona ooka Sesa ko odia bileho binde adoakadea ta dii mbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Iyena epaliti bobala bo moto omɔti aɛnɛ Sesa; dongedja oko iyona odonga ta dii Ndjakomba moto oɛnɛ Sesa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1, 18. </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Oko iboa, naotɔndeakadeani, sooti mɛnɛ bo: iyona odhimi adii na bomɔ bo kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nadii mapa ma bomɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Bakɔkɔ ba bino bayaka mana ta edhu ko baso bagwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Endelo mapa imimi madonga ta busa madii imia ma bo moto iyona omayakadea adae pɛpɛ bogwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Mbi nadii mapa ma bomɔ imi madonga ta busa. Moto akamayaka mapa ma mina, aheladea kɔbili na kɔbili. Mapa mapadea mbi, edii mokuku mo mbi; namopadea bɛngi ngondo edie bomɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Iyana boa Bayudha babukanaka na ngulu mɛnɛ ta tei e bobo; basawadjaka iboa: «Ndenge ndani moto iyoo abwani bolopa mokuku mo nde lomoyake?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakani sooti mɛnɛ bo: omiti yakani mokuku mo Mwana o moto ko omiti mwakani makiya ma nde, adaetebini na bomɔ ta tei e bino. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Iyona oyakadea mokuku mo mbi ko omwakadea makiya ma mbi adabi na bomɔ bo kɔbili ko mbi na mosɔmbedjabi ta bomɔ ta busa bo suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Modjɔ mo mokuku mo mbi modii mia ma sooti, ko makiya ma mbi madii emweli e sooti. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Moto iyoo oyaki mokuku mo mbi ko omwaki makiya ma mbi adii ta tei e mbi ko mbi ta tei e nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Sesa iyo olomani adii na bomɔ ko nahelakadea tina e nde; oko boa, iyoo oyakakadea ni aheladea na ndjea e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Indja mapa imimi madonga ta busa. Madiiti ondingo imia mayaka bakɔkɔ ba bino, ibibi bagwa. Endelo iyona oyakadea mapa imimi ahelabi kɔbili na kɔbili.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu abala mɛko mimina imia ehole elehaka iyo ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha e Kapalanaume.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mibalo mi bomɔ bo kɔbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ngɔngɔ dji bohokamedja Yesu, batingami ba nde banɛnɛ babala bo: «Iyana, agbasoi! Mobalo mondumba imu mobwani bodhimama ndenge nda?» <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu adjeba ta tei ende bo batingami bande banungunaka tina e modjɔ momina. Na tina emina abawadja bo: «Modjɔ momina mootsuini? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Modabi boni ehole eɛnɛbi ino Mwana o moto boiwea ta polo edaka iyo boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 1, 9-11.</char></note>? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Edii wɛtoko Mwembo imua mokapɛ bomɔ; moto iyo mɛnɛ abwaniti bokɔ eka emɔti. Mibalo imi misabala mbi na nu midi Mwembo ko bomɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Endelo edii na bakina ta tei e bino batadhimakadea.» Modjɔ mo, Yesu adjebaka donga mbangi bandani ibia badaaka pɛpɛ bodhima ko na iyona omokababi. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Abala naikina bo: «Indja tina ebala mbi na nu bo moto abwaniti bodoa ta dii mbi Sesa amiti mopa enɔli.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Bobanga ta ehole emina, batingami ba nde banɛnɛ basatuba na nde ko baidala na nde nakina. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu awadja batingami doomi na babae bo: «Ino pongono, opalakadeani okɛeni?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simona Petelo amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, akɛkɛdea iso ta dii nda? Wɛ odii na mibalo mi bomɔ bo kɔbili. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Iso, lodhimi ko lodjebakadea bo: wɛ odii Mosɛnɔke olomama Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 16, 16; Mal 8, 29; Luk 9, 20. </char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Editi mbi moto oohɔɔni ino doomi na babae? Endelo omɔti ta tei e bino adii djabulu!» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Abalaka tina e Yudhasi, mwana o Simona Isikaliote. Modjɔ mo Yudhasi nongo edaka iyo omɔti ta tei e batingami doomi na babae akɔkɔ mokaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 13, 2.21; 18, 5. </char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bangi bato baami ba Yesu baloni bomodhimea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu adalaka ta Galileya; aipalaka bohombana ta Yudhea, modjɔ mo bakondji ba Bayudha bahombaka bamoowoe. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Enakoboa tɛkɛ e Bayudha e Bikpangba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɛkɛ e Bikpangba edaka tɛkɛ e Bayudha eyeyoaka eyenga emɔti; ekɔmɔkɔ mbala emɔti ta tei e madidi ma yanga emɔti esonganaka na tɛkɛ e botsoa mbuma. Ebalɛnɛdjaka masu makɔɔ bana ba Isalɛlɛ ta edhu. Ta ndelo iyena esusu e tɛkɛ, mabota madikamaka ta tei e bikpangba bipikamaka ta tina e tɛkɛ e mina. Iboa Yelusalɛmɛ eimeaka esika e ndjendjo. Boindja Lew 23, 34-36; Dit 16, 13.</char></note> eimeaka mbuti. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Bana ba nango ba baami babala na nde bo: «Donga iya ko kɛɛ ta Yudhea, bɛngi bo batingami ba wɛ ibo pongono, baɛnɛ mikɔ mikɔkɔdea wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Moto takɔe mikɔ ta mbombi aka homba bo bamodjebe. Modjɔ mo okɔkɔdea mikɔ mimina, na mondumba mo bo moto mosusu amoɛnɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Nongoko boa, banginde ba baami baimodhimeaka. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu abala na bu: «Ehole e mbi epakinaimea. Ta tina e bino, ehole esusu edii epele. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Ngondo ebwaniti boolonani, endelo mbi, elonakadeani modjɔ mo nainedjakadea bo mikɔ mi yu midii mibe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ino kɛɛni ta tɛkɛ. Mbi, nitakɛɛdea ta tɛkɛ iyena, modjɔ mo ehole e mbi epakinaimea.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobala iboa, iyo adikama ta Galileya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta tɛkɛ e Bikpangba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Enakoboa, ehole ekɛɛ bangi nde ta tɛkɛ, Yesu pongono akɛɛ ta tɛkɛ, endelo aisaɛnɛmedja, asabomba. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Bakondji ba Bayudha ba mohombaka ta tɛkɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 7, 2 ko na nase.</char></note> ko bawadjaka bo: «Adii iyo djɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Batubanaka na bobuke ta tina e nde, ta ndanda e emumu e bato. Bakina babalaka bo: «Adii moto omɔti mopele.» Bakina babalaka bo: «Ngasa, apangoakadea bato.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Endelo pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti ohɔnɔkɔ bobala ta bohu ta tina e nde, modjɔ mo ibo basusu babangaka bakondji ba Bayudha. <verse eid="JHN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Tɛkɛ eimea ta ndanda, iyana akwea Yesu ta tepelo ko abanga boleha. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Bayudha bakamoa ko basawadjaka bo: «Ndenge ndani moto iyo akadjebe bobuke iyo moto odaa pɛpɛ boikoa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 13, 54; Luk 2, 47.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Eleho epakadea mbi editi embi mɛnɛ, endelo edii e iyona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Moto omɔti akapala bokɔ bolulea bo Ndjakomba adjebadea bo eleho iye e mbi edongi adii Ndjakomba kaoko nabalakadea ta tina e mbi mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Iyona obalakadea tina e kombe e nde ahombakadea ekumu e nde iyo mɛnɛ. Endelo iyona ohombakadea ekumu e moto omoloma abalakadea sooti ko aditi na bobe ta tei ende <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mose aiopani mobeko? Endelo pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti o bino okamoise ta mosala. Tina ehombakadea nanu oowoenini nda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Emumu e bato emosɔmbedja bo: «Odii na mwembo mobe! Ohombakadea aoowoe nda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Nakɔi oto embete emɔti pɛ ko ino basusu okamoini na yu! <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Modjɔ mo Mose aopani mobeko mo bolena bana baami bipole, te ta elɔkɔ ebo edonga ta dii Mose, endelo ta modjɔ mo bo edonga ta dii bakɔkɔ ba boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 12, 3; Mba 17, 10-13.</char></note>, ino odhimini bolena moto epole ta busa bo sabata. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Okalena mwana moomi epole ta busa bo sabata bɛngi bo mobeko mo Mose mosumame, tina ndani elumanakadea na nu na kɛlɛ na mbi modjo mo naheledji moto mobimba ta busa bo sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 5, 8-9.</char></note>? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Pɛpɛ bosambedjani aelɔkɔe miso ma bato. Sambedjani na bosooti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Lew 19, 15; Isa 11, 4.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adi Masiya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ndambo e bato ba Yelusalɛmɛ babalaka bo: «Editi iyoo ohombakadea ibo ba owoe? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Indja: iyoyo obalakadea ta bhudha ko batabalakadea na nde nongo eka emɔti! Bakondji ba biso basipoadea bo adii Masiya? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Endelo ehole eenɛmɛbi Masiya, pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti odjebadea esika edongi iyo, endelo iso lodjebakadea polo edongi moto omina.» <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Iboa Yesu olehaka ta tepelo; agama bo: «Odjebakadeani mɛnɛ eka edii mbi ko esika edongi mbi? Ediiti tina e mbi mɛnɛ bɛngi nadoe, endelo iyona olomani adii bosooti. Ko ino otamodjebakadeani. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mbi, namodjebakadea modjɔ mo nakɛkɛadonge adii iyo ko edii iyo moto olomani.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Iboa bahomba bamopee, endelo pɛpɛ nongo moto obakea ebɔ diko di nde, modjɔ mo ngonga ende eipaka imea. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Naboa ta ndanda e emumu e bato, banɛnɛ bamodhimea. Babalaka bo: «Ehole edoabi Masiya, akɔɔbi na bonɔ bimbete bi bokamodja bonɔ idjidji djisakɔɔ moto iyoyo?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basindjili balomami tina e bopea Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Bapalisai baoka eka ebalaka bo na kɔpi e nase ta tei emumu e bato ta tina e Yesu. Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ na Bapalisai baloma ba basindjili ba tepelo bɛngi bamopee. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu abala bo: «Nadii nanu naikina moo ehole mokɛkɛ, ngɔngɔ djimina nakɛkɛdeakɛe adii iyona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Ohombadeanini, endelo otadiadeanini, modjɔ mo obwanitini bokɛɛ iho ta polo edabi mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Bayudha basawadjana ta ndanda e bobo: «Akɛdea iyo djɔ bɛngi bo iso lodae pɛpɛ bomodia? Ekɛdea iyo adii Bayudha ibia banangana ta tei e ba Gɛlɛki ko ekɛdea iyo na bileho bi nde ta dii ba Gɛlɛki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe e Bagɛlɛki ebalakadea iya ibia badii pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha na bonɔ Bayudha ibia bakahelame sokolu e Palesitine.</char></note>? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Etingodjakadea kɔpi iyena esabala iyo nde: Ohombadeanini, endelo otadiadeanini, modjɔ mo otahɔnɔni boimea iho ta esika edii mbi?»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dua dji madiba ma bomɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Busa bo suka bo tɛkɛ bodaaka busa bomɔti bonɔi bonɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 23, 36.</char></note>. Busa bomina ibua, Yesu aema diko, ko agama bo: «Moto omɔti akaoka posa e bomwaka, adoe ta dii mbi ko amwake. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />“Iyona odhimeini, dua dji madiba ma bomɔ djikɛlɛdea ta molema mo nde”, ta mondumba mobalakadea Makomi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu abalaka tina e Mwembo bo ibo bamodhimeaka bamodiabi. Ta ehole emina iyena, Mwembo moipetaka paama, modjɔ mo Yesu aipaka angɔdjɔmɔ ta ekumu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emumu e bato esakabani ta tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ngɔngɔ dji booka mibalo mimina, bakina ta tei emumu, basabaleaka bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ moto iyo adii Motɛli!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bakina babalaka bo: «Edii Masiya!» – «Endelo, bakina basɔmbedjaka, Masiya abwani bodonga ta Galileya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 1, 46; 7, 52.</char></note>? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Makomi matabalakadea bo Masiya adaadea motitani o Dhapiti ko adongadea ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ngando ehelama Dhapiti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 2Sa 7, 12; Mik 5, 1; Mat 2, 5.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ta tina emina, emumu e bato esakabana ta tina e Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bato bamɔti ta tei e bobo bapalaka bamopee, endelo pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obakea ebɔ diko dinde.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bopokotoi bo bakondji ba Bayudha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Basindjili ba tepelo basɔmbɔ ta dii banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na Bapalisai babawadja bo: «Tina ndani ohulitini na Yesu?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Basindjili basɔmbedja bo: «Ngasa moto tabale ondingo iyo!» – <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Bapalisai babawadja naikina bo: «Ino bɛnɛ osakinini baokoseeni, pongono? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Edii na moto omɔti ta tei e bakondji kaoko omɔti o Bapalisai omodhimea? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Endelo bato bamina baidjebaka mobeko mo Mose, badii bato ba mondingɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Endelo Nikodɛmɛ adaaka omɔti o bia badaaka ena: edii iyo moto okɛɛ aindja Yesu boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 3, 1-2.</char></note> mɛnɛ. Abala na bu ibo: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Bobwana na mobeko mo biso, lobwani botitedja moto na ikambo ta ndelo edii iso pɛpɛ bomohokamedja kona pɛ bodjeba modjɔ mokɔi iyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 1, 16.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Edii wɛ pongono moto o Galileya? Kundodjana Makomi ko oɛnɛdea bo pɛpɛ nongo motɛli omɔti odonga ta Galileya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 1, 46; 7, 41.</char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 7:52">Yesu ko na mwali o bɔɔli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:52">[ <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, moto na moto ayana ta ndako ende<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikomi di 7, 53-8, 11 idiiti ta mikanda miyou ko ta makomi ma minɔkɔ mi latɛ, siliake na minɔkɔ mikina. Mikanda mikina bakaikome ngungusa, na bonɔ ta suka e buku e Yoane. </char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Endelo Yesu akɛɛ ta ngomba e mele mi Olive<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 11, 1 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Ehuma mɛnɛ ngɔngɔ dji isu dimɔti, asɔmbɔ ta tepelo ko bato basusu babatama mbuti na nde. Adaa na mobondo ko abanga bopa bileho bi nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Balehi ba mibeko ko na Bapalisai bamolwɛɛ mwali omɔti otanea ibo akɔɔ bɔɔli. Bamoemea ta boso bo bato basusu <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />ko babala na Yesu: «Molehi, mwali iyoyo lomotanei oko ta ehole edaki iyo akɔɔ bɔɔli. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mose ta mobeko aloloma bo loowoe bali ba mondumba mu na mabɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 20, 10; Dit 22, 22-24.</char></note>. Ko wɛ, ebalakadea wɛ tina e modjɔ momina nde?» <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Babalaka iboa tina ebomopikea elambo bɛngi badie enɔli e bomopunda. Endelo Yesu asunama ko abanga bokoma na mosapi ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Abo basɛsɛnɛkɛ na bomowadja, Yesu asaninodja ko abala na bu: «Moto odii pɛ boda na pekato ta ndanda e bino amolɛ ibɔkɔ di boso.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ngɔngɔ djimina asumana naikina ko asɔmbɔ bokoma ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ehole eoka ibo mobalo momina, basatuba omɔti omɔti, bobanga na bato bapingamake. Ko Yesu adika iyo mɛnɛ na mwali, odaaka aemi boso bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Iboa Yesu asaninodja naikina ko abala na nde: «Bopele, ibo bado? Pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti osaodumba na ikambo?» – <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Asɔmbedja bo: «Kumu pɛpɛ nongo moto.» Yesu abala bo: «Mbi pongono nitaodumbakadea. Kɛɛ, endelo pɛpɛ bokɔ pekato naikina.»]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, bohu bo ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu abala na bu naikina bo: «Nadii bohu bo ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 49, 6; Mat 5, 14; Yoa 9, 5.</char></note>. Moto okimanini adiadea bohu bo mohelo ko atadaladea naikina ta modidi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Bapalisai babala na nde bo: «Wɛ moto obalakadea tati ewɛ mɛnɛ; tati ewɛ editi na tina.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu abasɔmbedja: «Nongo mbi nakabala tati e mbi mɛnɛ, tati embi edii e sooti, modjɔ mo nadjebakadea esika edonga mbi ko esika ekɛkɛdea mbi. Endelo ino, otadjebakadeani na esika ekɛkɛdea mbi adonge ko ekɛkɛdea mbi akɛe. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Ino okasambedjeni na ndenge e bato; mbi te na sambedje moto. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ndelo djisusu, djikadie mbi enɔli e bosambedja, bosambadja bo mbi bodii sooti, modjɔ mo tenadae mbi mɛnɛ, endelo Sesa iyoo olomani akadae na mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ta tei e mobeko mo bino ekomama bo bato babae bakabala tati emɔti, tati emina edii sooti. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Mbi nabakadea tati e mbi mɛnɛ ko Sesa olomani akabale pongono tati tina e mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bamowadja bo: «Sangwao adii iyo djɔ?» Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Otadjebakadeani na mbi edɛe Sesa. Osoodjebanini, okɔki djebani pongono Sesa.» <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu abala kɔpi idjia ehole elehaka iyo ta tepelo, ta esika ekadedje bo makabo. Moto nongo omɔti aimopea, modjɔ mo ehole e nde eipaka imea.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">«Obwanitini bokɛ iho akɛkɛdea mbi»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu abala na bu naikina: «Mbi nakɛdea; ohombadeanini, endelo ogwadeani na pekato e bino. Iho akɛkɛdea mbi ino obwanitini boimea.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Bayudha basabaleana bo: «Ekɛkɛdea iyo asaowa iyo mɛnɛ, bɛngi abale bo: “Iho akɛkɛdea mbi ino obwanitini boimea”?» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Ino odini bato ba kpɔtɔ, mbi nadonga ta busa. Ino odini bato ba ngondo iye, mbi naditi moto o ngondo iye. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Natina emina nabalaki na nu bo ogwadeani ta pekato e bino. Modjɔ mo ogwadeani ta pekato e bino omiti dhimani bo “Mbi nadii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Boi 3, 14-15.</char></note>”.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Babalaka na nde bo: «Wɛ odii nda?» Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Iyona omaki mbi otɔndeani donga ta mbangi. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ta tina e bino nadii na mɛko minɛnɛ mi bobala ko mi bosambedja. Endelo iyona olomani adii sooti, ko mbi nalakakadea ta ngondo midjɔ imia mioka mbi ta dii iyona olomani.» <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Baisipoa bo abalaka nabu tina e Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Iboa Yesu abala na bu: «Ehole eangɔdjɔdea ino Mwana o moto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 3, 14.</char></note>, odjebadani bo “Mbi nadii”; odjebadeani mbi tenakɔe modjɔ momɔti na bopala bo mbi mɛnɛ: nakabale oko mɛko milehani Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Iyona olomani adii na mbi; aikinani mbi mɛnɛ, modjɔ mo mbi nakakɔe oko midjɔ mikamosepedje.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Iyana abalaka Yesu iboa, banɛnɛ bamodhimea.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba sɔmi ko na babuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Iboa Yesu abalaka na Bayudha ibia bamodhimeaka bo: «Okama dikamani oabaneani kɔpi e mbi, odini mɛnɛ batingami ba mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Odjebadeani bosooti, ko bosooti boimedjadeani basɔmi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Lodii batitani ba Abalayama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 3, 9; Luk 3, 8.</char></note> ko loidaa nongo busa bomɔti babuli ba moto. Ndenge ndani ebwani wɛ bobala na su bo: “Oimeadeani ta bosɔmi”?» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Oko iboa, ko naotɔndeakadeani, sooti mɛnɛ bo: moto mosusu okɔkɔdea pekato adi mobuli o pekato. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Enakoboa, mobuli tadikame seko ta ndako, endelo mwana iyo, akadikame seko. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ekada bo mwana akaotingoani ta ibuli, odadeani sooti mɛnɛ batingoamake. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nadjebakadea bo odini batitani ba Abalayama. Endelo ohombakadeani oowoenini, modjɔ mo olonakadeani mibalo mi mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Mbi, nabalakadea midjɔ minedjani Sesa, endelo ino, okɔkɔdeani midjɔ miotɔndeani sange bino.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Sange biso, edii Abalayama.» Yesu abala na bu bo: «Oso daani mɛnɛ bana ba Abalayama, okaki kɔɔni midjɔ mikɔɔ iyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Endelo edɛdiyeye, nongo asaotɔndeani mbi sooti ebolodji mbi ta dii Ndjakomba, ohombakadeani owoenini. Abalayama aikɔ mikɔ mondumba imu! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ino, okɔkɔdeani mikɔ mi sange bino.» Babala na nde bo: «Iso loibotama na bɔɔli. Lodii na sange moto omɔti pɛ, Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu abala na bu: «Ndjakomba asoada Sangwanu okɔki palanini, modjɔ mo, mbi nadonga ta dii Ndjakomba ko nadii iya tina e nde. naidoa tina e mbi mɛnɛ, endelo edii iyo moto olomani. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ndenge ndani edakadea nanu pɛpɛ bosipoa eka ebalakadea mbi na nu? Modjɔ mo otahɔnɔkɔdeani bohokamedja mobalo mo mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Ino odini na sangwanu djabulu, ko opalakadeani bokɔɔ oko bopala bo sangwanu. Iyo, adaaka mooweli o bato donga ta mbangi. Aida nongo busa bomɔti ta bosooti, modjɔ mo bosooti boditi ta tei ende. Ehole ekakose iyo, akabale oko mondumba mokɔɔmɔ iyo, modjɔ mo adii mokosi ko sange bokuta. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Endelo mbi, nabalakadea bosooti ko na tina emina ino otadhimeakadeanini. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Moto ndani ta ndanda e bino, obwani boinedja bo nakɔɔ pekato? Ko nakabala bosooti tina ndani ino otadhimeakadeanini? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Moto odii o Ndjakomba akaoke mibalo mi Ndjakomba. Endelo oditini ba Ndjakomba na tina emina otaokakadeanini.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko Abalayama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Bayudha basɔmbedja Yesu bo: «Loditi na molonga mo bobala bo wɛ odii Mosamalia ko odii na mwembo mobe?» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Mbi, naditi na mwembo mobe, endelo nakasume Sesa ko ino, olonini bosumani. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Mbi nitahombakadea ekumu e mbi mɛnɛ. Edii na iyona oka ehombe tina e mbi ko iyona okasambedje. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Oko iboa, naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: moto akasuma mibalo mo mbi, atagwabi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Natina emina, Bayudha babala na nde bo: «Edɛdiye, lodhimi bo odii na mwembo mobe! Abalayama agwa, na batɛli pongono bagwa, ko wɛ, obalakadea bo: “Moto akasuma mibalo mi mbi atagwabi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Abalayama, sangwasu, agwa: olɛnɛkɛdea bo odii monɛnɛ bonɔ iyo? Batɛli pongono bagwa. Osatukoakadea olongo nda?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Naka sakumedja mbi mɛnɛ, ekumu e mbi edii ngasa. Edii sange mbi moto okumedjakadeani. Iyona obalakadea ino bo: “Adii Ndjakomba o biso”, <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />enakoboa otamodjebakadeani. Mbi na modjebakadea. Ko naso nabala bo: “Nita modjebakadea”, nadaadea mokosi ondingo ino. Endelo na modjebakadea ko nakasume mibalo mi nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abalayama, sange bino, asepa na malɛi ma boɛnɛ busa bo mbi; aboɛnɛ ko aso asepa na bu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Bayudha babala na nde bo: «Opakinaimedja nongo bianga tuku itano ko oɛnɛ Abalayama?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Oko iboa, naotɔndeakadeani, sooti mɛnɛ bo: boso bo Abalayama abotame, “Mbi nadii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1, 1-3.</char></note>”.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Iboa baandoa mabɔkɔ bɛngi ba molɛɛ, endelo Yesu abolama ko aimana ta tepelo.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji moto o miso mago banga bobotama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Na ndjea, Yesu aɛnɛ moto odaaka na miso mago donga bobotama. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Batingami bande ba mowadja bo: «Molehi, tina ndani moto iyo abotama na miso mago edii tina e pekato dji nde mɛnɛ kaoko tina e pekato dji baboti bande<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 20, 5.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Editi nongo tina e pekato dji nde, ko tina e pekato dji baboti ba nde. Adii moto o miso mago bɛngi bo mikɔ mi Ndjakomba miɛnɛmɛ ta dii iyo. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Busa bokaya, lotungi bokokedja mikɔ mi iyona oloma ni. Bulu bokɛkɛadoe, ehole e bo nongo moto omɔti abwaniti bosala. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ehole edii mbi ta ngondo, nadii bohu bo ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 8, 12 ko na nase.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobala iboa, Yesu atsuea masɔi ta kpɔtɔ ko akɔɔ baasɛtɛ na masɔi ma nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mal 8, 23.</char></note>; mbunoko asiana miso ma moto o miso mago na masɛtɛ ma mina <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />ko abala na nde bo: «Kɛɛ asasose boso ta ediba e Siloe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ediba e Siloe edaka ta tei e bikuka bi Yelusalɛmɛ. Boindja 2Ba 20, 20; Isa 8, 6 ko na nase.</char></note>.» Kombe emina etingodjakadea bo: «Molomami». Moto o miso mago akɛɛ iho asosa boso ko ehole ehula yo aɛnɛkɛ! <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Badjebani ba nde ko na bato ibia ba moɛnɛkɛ asɛngɛ leka boso bawadjaka bo: «Iyonao te moto odaaka na mobondo aasɛngɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />39 Bato bamɔti babalaka bo: «Oko iyo.» Bakina babalaka bo: «Ngasa, iyona te iyo endelo akuana na nde.» Ko iyo mɛnɛ abalaka bo: « Edii oko mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bamowadja bo: «Ndenge ndani edipoami na miso ma wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Asɔmbedja bo: «Moto iyo okabee bo Yesu akɔi baasɛtɛ, amasingini ta miso ma mbi ko abala bo: “Kɛɛ asasose boso ta Siloe.” Nakɛi iho, ko ngɔngɔ dji bosasosa naɛnɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bamowadja bo: «Moto omina ado?» Asɔmbedja bo: «Nitadjeba.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawadja ma Bapalisai ta dii moto ohela na o miso mago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Iboa baso bakɛɛ na moto iyona odaakabi na miso mago ta dii Bapalisai. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Enakoboa, edaka wɛtoko ta busa bo sabata busa bokɔɔ Yesu masɛtɛ mbunoko amodipoi miso. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Na tina emina Bapalisai, ibo pongono, bamowadja mondumba ndani mosɔmbɔ na nde boɛnɛ naikina. Abasɔmbedja bo: «Aisaki masɛtɛ ta miso ma mbi, nasasosaki ko na mbala emɔti naɛni.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Ndambo e Bapalisai babalaka: «Moto okɔi modjɔ momina adongiti ta dii Ndjakomba, modjɔ mo atasumakadea mobeko mo sabata.» Endelo bakina bawadjaka bo: «Ndenge ndani moto o pekato abwani bokɔ bimbete bibokamodja mondumba imu?» Ko babɔtɔkɔ ta tei e bobo. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bapalisai bawadja naikina na moto ohela na miso mago: «Ko wɛ, ebalakadea wɛ nde tina e moto oheledji miso ma wɛ?» Asɔmbedja bo: «Adii motɛli» <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Bayudha baidhima bo moto iyona odaaka na miso mago ko asɔmbɔ naikina boɛnɛ. Na tina emina baso babea baboti ba nde <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />bɛngi babawadje. Babawadja bo: «Iyonao adii mwana o bino? Odhimakadeani bo iyo abotama na miso mago? Enɔɔmɔki mɛnɛ nde bɛngi asɔmbe boɛnɛ naikina?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Baboti basɔmbedja bo: «Lodjebakadea bo adii mwana o biso ko abotama miso mago. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Endelo lotadjebakadea eka enɔɔmɔki bɛngi aimee boɛnɛ ko lotadjebakadea nongo na moto osaheledja miso ma nde. Mowadjani: adii moto mopingamake asɔmbedje iyo mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Baboti bande babalaka iboa modjɔ mo badaaka na bɔɔ bo bakondji ba Bayudha. Modjɔ mo, Bayudha badhimeana bo omɔti ta tei e bobo akamadhima ibo Yesu adii Masiya bamobenganadea ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Indja tina ebala na baboti bo: «Adii moto mopingamake, mowadjani!» <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Bapalisai babea naikina moto iyona odaaka na miso mago ko babala na nde: «Pa Ndjakomba ekumu na bobala bosooti. Lodjebakadea bo moto iyona adii moto o pekato.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Asɔmbedja bo: «Natadjebakadea kaoko adii moto o pekato kao ngasa. Endelo nadjebakadea eka emɔti: nadaaka moto o miso mago ko edɛdiyeye naɛnɛkɛdea.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bamowadja bo: «Eokɔi iyo nde? Ndenge edipoi na nde miso ma wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Asɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeani modjɔ momina ehele, ko oiokani. Tina epalakadea na nu bomooka na ikina nda? Epalakadea ino, pongono, oimeeni batingami bande?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bamosinga ko babala na nde bo: «Wɛ moto odii motingami o moto omina! Iso, lodii batingami ba Mose. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Iso lodjebakadea bo Ndjakomba abalea Mose; endelo iyo, lotadjebakadea esika edongi iyo!» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Moto omina abasɔmbedja bo: «Indja bopele mɛnɛ modjɔ mo bokamwa: otadjebakadeani esika edongi iyo ko edɛdiyeye aheledji miso ma mbi! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Lodjebakadea bo Ndjakomba taokee bato ba pekato, endelo akaokee moto mosusu okamosume ko okakɔe bopala bo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Isa 1, 15; Bdj 34, 16; 66, 18; Bik 15, 29.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Loioka pongono babala bo baheledji moto o botama na miso mago. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Moto iyo asoada pɛpɛ bodonga ta dii Ndjakomba, abwanakiti bokɔɔ eka emɔti.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Wɛ donga bobotama oboki mosusu ta tei e pekato ko wɛ opalakadea ololehe?» Ko bamobengana o sokolu.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo miso bo sooti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu aoka bo bamobengana. asongana na nde ko amowadja bo: «Wɛ odhimi Mwana o moto?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Asɔmbedja bo: «Tɔndeani iyo adii nda, Kumu bɛngi bo, namodhimee.» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu abala na nde: « Oɛni moto iyo, obalakadea na wɛ, edii wɛtoko iyo.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Moto omina abala bo: «Nadhimi, Kumu», ko akwa na magbunda ta boso bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Iboa Yesu abala bo: «Mbi nadoa ta ngondo iye bɛngi sambi ebolodje polo: bɛngi bato ba miso mago baɛnɛ ko bɛngi bo ibia baɛnɛkɛdea baimee bato ba miso mago.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Ndambo e Bapalisai badaaka mbuti na nde, baoka mibalo mi nde ko baso bamowadja: «Iso pongono, lodii bato ba miso mago?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Osoodaani bato ba miso mago, otadaadeani na pekato; endelo asabala ino bo: “Loɛnɛkɛdea”, odikamini bato ba pekato.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ekuanedji e mobanei o bhata ko na bhata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu abala bo: «Sooti, mɛnɛ naotɔndeakadeani bo: iyona odai pɛpɛ bokwea ta ikutu di bhata ta modipe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na bulu, tito badaaka baboli ta tei e ikutu di mabanga makakanu ko baisaka sindjili omɔti adaaka ena.</char></note>, endelo aiwei dɔɔngɔ dikina, iyo adii moibi, ko mopundji. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Endelo iyona okwei ta modipe adii mobanei o bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Sindjili abwani bodipoa modipe ko bhata bakaoke moholi monde. Akabee bhata bande mɛnɛ na kombe ko akabaimanedje sokolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ehole ebaimanedji iyo basusu sokolu, akadale boso bo bobo ko ibo bakamokimane, modjɔ mo bakadjebe moholi monde. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Endelo bhata batakimanadea moto o tongono; bamotiadea bohali, modjɔ mo batadjebakadea moholi mo nde.» <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu abala nabu ekuanedji iye, endelo ibo baisipoa eka ebalaka iyo na bu.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mobanei o bhata mopele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Natina emina, Yesu abala na bu naikina: «Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadeani bo: Edii mbi moto odii modipe mo bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Ibia basusu badoa boso bo mbi badii baibi ko bapundji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Yil 23, 1-2; Edk 34, 2-3.</char></note>; endelo bhata baibahokamedja. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Mbi moto odii modipe. Moto aka akakwea ta ndjea e mbi aheladea, abwani bokwea ko boimana, ko ataneadea mia ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Moibi akadoe oto tina e boiba, boowa ko bobeedja. Mbi, nadoa bɛngi bo badie mohelo ko bamodie bobuke mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Mbi nadii mobanei o bhata mopele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndj 23, 1; Isa 40, 11; Edk 34, 15; 37, 24.</char></note>. Mobanei mopele akadae mbuti na bopa mohelo mo nde mɛnɛ tina e bhata ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Moto okasale oto tina e palanga aditi mɛnɛ mobanei o bhata; bhata badiiti ba nde. Abwani bobakina; ko asatiedji ta ehole eɛnɛdea iyo swa akwei ko asasabi diko di bhata ko abanaganedji. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Indja eka ebwani boimana modjɔ mo iyona okasale tina e palanga aditi na pɛhɛ na bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Nadii mobanei o bhata mopele. Nakadjebe bhata ba mbi ko bhata bambi bakadjebeni, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />oko mondumba mokadjebeni Sesa ko mbi pongono nakadjebe Sesa oko iboa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 11, 27; Luk 10, 22.</char></note>. Ko nakapɛ bomɔ bo mbi tina e bhata ba mbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nadii pongono na bakina bhata ibia badii pɛ boda ta ikutu idii. Natungi pongono bo badaledja nahule na bu, baokadea moholi mo mbi, ko baimeadea bwela bomɔti bo bhata ko mobanei omɔti. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Sesa akapaleni modjɔ mo napi bomɔ bo mbi tina e bobobolodja naikina. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Pɛpɛ nongo moto okatoadeani bomɔ bomina, endelo mbi nabopi na bopala bo mbi mɛnɛ nadii na bokondji bo bopa bomɔ bo mbi ko nadii na bokondji bo bobobolodja naikina. Iyena ebwani na mobeko modia mbi ta dii sesa.» <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Bayudha babɔtɔɔ pongono tatei ebobo naikina tina e mibalo mimina. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Banɛnɛ tatei ebobo babalaka bo: «Apeami na mwembo mobe! Adii na igboma tina e mohokamedjakadea na nu nda?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bakina babalaka: bo «Kɔpi dji nde djidiiti dji moto odii na mwembo mobe. Mwembo mobe mobwani bodipoa miso ma moto okadae pɛpɛ boɛnɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ta masu mamina, tɛkɛ emɔti e Bayudha edaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ edaka busa bo Bobudjeama bo tepelo ko edaka ehole e piɔ enɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɛkɛ e Bobudjeama bo tepelo ekɔmɔkɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta bokimana suka e songe o doomi na babae bɛngi balɛne bobɔngedjama ko na bobujdjeama bo etumbelo e mbeka e tepelo ekɔmɔ na moto opalaka ekomi e Bayudha o beaka bo Yudhasi Makabe ta yanga e 165 kaoko 164 boso bo Yesu.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu apukanaka ta mbalasani e Sɔlɔmɔ ta tepelo. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Bayudha bamohika na ikina ko babalaka na nde bo: «Mbunoko ndelo ndani edadea wɛ oalokina milema diko? Lo tɔndea sooti mɛnɛ, ekadaa bo odii Masiya.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: « Nabala na nu modjɔ mo mina ehele, endelo todhimeenini. Eka ebalakadea tati e mbi wɛtoko bimbete djikɔkɔdea mbi ta kombe e Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Endelo ino otadhimakadeanini, modjɔ mo odiitini ta ndanda e bhata ba mbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Bhata ba mbi bakaoke moholi mo mbi; mbi nabadjebakadea ko bakimanakadeani. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Napakadea bomɔ bo kɔbili, batabungamabi ko pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obatinoabi ta mɔmɔ ma mbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Eka epaani Sesa enɔi bobuke bonɔ losusu ko moto nongo omɔti abwaniti boetinoa ta mɔmɔ ma Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Mbi na Sesa, lodii omɔti.» <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Bayudha baandoa naikina mabukutulu bɛngi bamolɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 8, 59.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Naonidjani bimbete binɛnɛ bipele bidonga ta dii Sesa. Ta tina e bimbete bimina ohombakadeani olɛnini mabɔkɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Bayudha bamosɔmbedja bo: «Lotapalakadea loowoe na bola mabɔkɔ eloke tingi na embete epele, endelo modjɔ mo osingakadea Ndjakomba: wɛ odii moto ko opalakadea osaimedje Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Lew 24, 16.</char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Ekomama ta mobeko mo bino bo Ndjakomba abala bo: “Odiini ba ndjakomba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 82, 6.</char></note>” <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Lodjebakadea bo obwaniti bodongedja eka ebala Makomi. Enakoboa, Ndjakomba abea ba ndjakomba ibia bapa iyo Mobalo mo nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Ko mbi, Sesa ahɔɔni ko alomani ta ngondo. Ndenge ndani ebwani na nu bobala bo nasingakadea Ndjakomba modjɔ mo naotɔndeini bo nadii Mwana o Ndjakomba? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Namiti kɔɔ mikɔ mi Sesa, pɛpɛ bodhimeanini. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Endelo naka mikɔɔ, nongo omiti dhimeanini, dhimeani nongo mikɔ mimina bɛngi odjebeni ko osipoeni na mbala emɔti bo Sesa adii ta tei e mbi ko mbi nadii ta tei e Sesa.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Na tina emina, bahombaka naikina bomopea, endelo asadindedja swɛ na bu. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu asɔmbɔ naikina ta ngunda ekina e Yɔlɔdane ta esika ebatisaka Yoane boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 1, 28.</char></note> ko aso adikama iyana <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Bato banɛnɛ badoa ta dii iyo. Babalaka bo: «Yoane aikɔɔ nongo embete emɔti e bokamodja, endelo midjɔ misusu mibala yo tina e moto iyo midaka sooti.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ko iyana, bato banɛnɛ badhimea Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Bogwa bo Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Moto omɔti na kombe Ladjalo akwa na epeko. Adaka ta Betania, ngando edikamaka Malia ko na ngɛnɛ e nde Malata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Luk 10, 38-39. Ladjalo edaka kombe emɔti ebeamaka mɛnɛ na ngulu ta ehole e Yesu; edii mobea mo bokuedja mo kombe e Eleadjale (Ndjakomba amokamoi). Boindja Mal 11, 1 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Malia adaaka mwali iyona osopea malasi ta mako ma Kumu ko amahakoa na swee dji nde, ko edaka wɛtoko ngɛnɛ e nde Ladjalo moto opekaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 12, 3.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ba ngɛnɛ i bato bali babae baloma moto omɔti atɔndea Yesu bo: «Kumu, moto opalaka wɛ adii na epeko.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ehole eoka Yesu gala emina, abala bo: «Epeko e Ladjalo etamoowadea; ekɔdea bo einedje ekumu e Ndjakomba ko boinedja pongono ekumu e Mwana o Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu apalaka Malata na mwanango o mwali, ko na Ladjalo <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Enakoboa, ehole eoka yo babala bo Ladjalo apekakadea, adikama naikina masu mabae ta esika edaka yo, <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />ngɔngɔ djimina abala na batingami ba nde bo: «Losɔmbeni ta Yudhea.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Batingami bamosɔmbedja bo: «Molehi, kanga pɛpɛ ekoka iya bahombakabi baoowoe na mabɔkɔ ko osɔmbe iho koko naikina?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Edii na ngonga doomi na ibae ta isu dimɔti, te iboa? Ko moto akadala na busa boyake, abwaniti botaa ibaku, modjɔ mo aɛnɛkɛdea bohu bo ngondo iye. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Endelo moto akadala na bulu, abwani botaa ibaku modjɔ mo bohu boditi ta tei ende.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ngɔngɔ dji nde bobala modjɔ momina, Yesu abakea bo: «Minasu Ladjalo awɛi hiɔ, endelo mbi nakɛdea amosisodja.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Batingami bamosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, ekada awɛi hiɔ, aheladea na epeko e nde.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ta bosooti, Yesu abalaka tina e yogo e Ladjalo, endelo batingami balɛnɛkɛ bo abalaka tina e hiɔ dji momɛsɛno. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Iboa Yesu adoi abatɔndea sooti bo: «Ladjalo agwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Nadii na sepi tina e bino modjɔ mo mbi nadakiti iho, iboa odhimeadeanini. Endelo lokɛeni iho ta dii iyo.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Iboa Toma iyo obeaka bo na kombe e Ipasa abala na batingami bakina bo: «Iso lokɛeni pongono, logwɛ na nde engbanga emɔti!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adii ipuso ko na mohelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ehole eimea Yesu, aoka bo Ladjalo akɔkɔ masu manei ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Abo Betania edii mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ mbuti na kilomɛtɛlɛ isato, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Bayudha banɛnɛ badoaka ta dii Malata na Malia abaindja ta yogo e mwange bobo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ehole eoka Malata boni e Yesu akɛkɛdea adoe, akɛkɛ asongana na nde; endelo Malia adikaka ta ndako. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malata abala na Yesu bo: «Kumu, osoodaa nasu iyaya, ka mwange mbi agwiti. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Endelo edɛdiyeye nadjebi bonie Ndjakomba aopadea eka ndani emowadjadea wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Mwangwao asisoadea ta bogwa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malata amosɔmbedja bo: «Nadjebakadea bonie asisoabi ta bopusoama bo bato bago, ta busa bo suka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Dan 12, 2.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Mbi nadii bopusoama ko na bomɔ. Moto iyoo odhimeini, nongo akagwa adabi na bomɔ; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />ko moto mosusu odii na bomɔ ko adhimeini atagwabi. Odhimi modjɔ momina?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malata asɔmbedja bo: «Sooti, Kumu, nadhimakadea bo wɛ odii Masiya, Mwana o Ndjakomba, iyoyo obwanaka bodoa ta ngondo.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ta mɛko mi mina, Malata akɛɛ abea mwange ende Malia ko amotɔndei na bopɛtɛ bo: «Molehi adii iyanao ko akambakadea bo okɛe.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ehole eoka Malia iboa, angɔɔ ko apota ta boso bo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Enakoboa Yesu aipaka imea ta ngando, endelo adaaka oko ta esika esonganaka iyo na Malata. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Ehole eɛnɛ Bayudha badaaka na Malia ta ndako ibibi badoaka amoindja Malia angɔi pɛpɛlɛ, bamokimana. Balɛdjɛkɛ bo iyo akɛkɛ ayea biyo ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Malia aimea ta esika edaaka Yesu; ehole emoɛnɛ iyo, asadumba ta mako ma nde ko abala na nde bo: «Kumu, osoodaa iyaya, ka mwange e mbi o moomi abwanakiti agwɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Iya amoɛnɛ Yesu ayea biyo, ko na bato badoaka na nde engbanga emɔti. Yesu aoka pɛhɛ enɛnɛ ko saya ta molema, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />ko aso abawadja bo: «Amoisabino djɔ?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, doa ko oɛnɛdea.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu ayea. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Iboa Bayudha babala bo: «Indjani mondumba momopalaka yo!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Endelo bato bakina ta ndanda e bobo babalaka bo: «Iyo moto odipoaka miso ma moto o miso mago<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 9, 6.</char></note>, abwanakiti pongono bosia Ladjalo adae pɛpɛ bogwa?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ladjalo asɔmbi ta bomɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu aoka naikina pɛhɛ enɛnɛ ta molema ko akɛɛ ta ikila. Edaka mombɔndɔ, ta tei e mabanga ko ta monɔkɔ momina badipa ibanga imɔti inɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta palesitine ta ehole e Yesu, mimbɔndɔ mi makila milongeamaka seko na ebende emɔti epolu ta mabanga manɛnɛnɛnɛ ko badipaka na ibanga ikina dinɛnɛ di ikilingoana ko ibatatake. Boindja Mat 27, 60; Mal 15, 46; Luk 24, 2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu abala bo: «Dongedjani ibanga». Malata, ngɛnɛ e mowei, abala na nde bo: «Kumu, apɔɔbi ehele, modjɔ mo esi bokɔ masu manɛi.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeakiti? Okamadhima, oɛnɛdea ekumu e Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Badongedja ibanga. Yesu angɔdjɔ miso o diko ko abala bo: «Sesa, naopi misakoa tina bo okaokeeni. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Nadjebakadea bo okaokeeni ehole esusu, nabali iboa tina e bato ibibi bahikini, bɛngi badhime bo wɛ moto olomani.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobala iboa, agama na ngulu: «Ladjalo, imana iyana!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Mowei aimana, mɔmɔ na mako ma nde madaaka manangake na bipasa bi bisendja ko boso bo nde bohuamaka na esendja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 2, 6-7. </char></note>. Iboa Yesu abala: «Motingoani ko mokinani akɛe.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayudha batombi meko e boowa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mal 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Bayudha banɛnɛ, ta tei e ibia badoaka adii Malia baɛnɛkɛ modjɔ mokɔɔ Yesu bamodhimea. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Endelo bakina Bayudha bakɛɛ ta dii Bapalisai ko babatubana modjɔ mokɔkɔ Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Iboa banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na Bapalisai baputoanedja Ikita dinɛnɛ ko babala bo: «Lokɔe bo? Modjɔ mo moto iyoyo akɔkɔdea midjɔ mi bokamoa minɛnɛnɛ! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Lokamokina akɔɔke iboa, bato basusu bamodhimeadea, ko pongono bakondji ba Baloma bakweadea, ko babedjakakadea tepelo e biso ko ekomi e biso!» <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Moto omɔti ta tei e bobo, kombe e nde Kaipa, iyo odaaka nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛnɛnɛ ta yanga iyena, abala na bu bo: «Ino otasipoakadeani! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Otadjebakadeani bo edii bopele moto omɔti agwɛ tina e bato basusu bɛngi ekomi esusu edae pɛpɛ bobeha?» <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Enakoboa aibalaka iboa tina e nde iyo mɛnɛ; endelo abo adaaka nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ ta yanga iyena, atɛlɛkɛ bo etungi na Yesu bogwa tina e ekomi e Bayudha, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />ko editi oko tina e ekomi emina, endelo tina e boputoanedja pongono esika emɔti bana basusu ba Ndjakomba ibia banangana. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Bobanga busa bomina, bakondji ba Bayudha batomba meko e boowa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Tina emina, Yesu akina bosaɛnɛmedja ta miso ma Bayudha. Akɛɛ ta ngando emɔti mbuti na edhu, kombe eyu Epalaime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epalaimi: ngando emina ekadae seko ta kilomɛtɛlɛ tuku ibae ta pamba e sadiko ko na pamba ekaimane modaakabusa.</char></note>, adikama iho na batingami ba nde.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Tɛkɛ e Bayudha e Pasika emeika mbuti, ko bato banɛnɛ badongaka ta ngando na ngando bakɛkɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ tina e bosasɛnodja boso bo tɛkɛ emina. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Iboa bahombaka Yesu ehole edaka bo ta tei e tepelo, ko babala bo: «Olɛdjɛkɛdeani bo? Aduadea ta tɛkɛ kaoko ngasa?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ na Bapalisai bapaka mobeko bo moto omɔti akadjeba esika edaaka Yesu, abadjebedje bɛngi bamopee.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Malia asopei malasi ta mako ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mal 14, 3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Masu masamano boso bo Pasika, Yesu aimea ta Betania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 11, 1 ko na nase.</char></note>, esika edaka Ladjalo, moto iyo osisodjaka iyo ta bogwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Iho, Malata amopaka mia. Ladjalo adaaka omɔti ta tei e bato ibia badaaka na Yesu ta mesa. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Iboa Malia atomba mboka e molangi mo malasi ma motswiya monɛnɛ, makɔɔmɔ na nale epele ko amasuoa ta mako ma Yesu, ngɔngɔ amahakoa na swe dji nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Luk 7, 37-38. </char></note>. Ndako esusu eluma na so e malasi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Iboa, omɔti o batingami ba nde na kombe e Yudhasi Isikaliote, iyona omokabadea, abala bo: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Tina edai na wɛ pɛpɛ botɛkɛ malasi mamina na pata dji palanga mikama misato bɛngi bo bapɛ na bakwali nda?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Aibalaka iboa modjɔ mo adaaka na ndjokwa na bakwali, endelo abala ndenge emina modjɔ mo adaaka moibi: adaaka mobanei o ibenga di palanga ko atombaka eka eisaka bo ena. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Endelo Yesu abala bo: «Kinani bomotungea! Akɔi iboa tina e bobwana na busa boisabinibo ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Odabini na bakwali ta ndanda e bino masu masusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Dit 15, 11.</char></note>, endelo mbi, otadabini na mbi masu masusu.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayudha batomba meko e boowa Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Emumu enɛnɛ e Bayudha eoka bo Yesu adaaka ta Betania. Baikɛkɛ iho oto elɔkɔ e Yesu, endelo bakɛɛ pongono bɛngi baɛnɛ Ladjalo iyoo osisodja Yesu ta yogo. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ batomba meko e boowa pongono Ladjalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />modjɔ mo Bayudha banɛnɛ babakinaka ta tina e nde ko badhimeaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akwei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mal 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ngɔngɔ dji busa bomɔti, emumu e bato banɛnɛ ibibi badoaka ta tɛkɛ e Pasika, eoka bo Yesu aimeaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ibo basusu batombaka magbangu ma mabia ko baimana ta ngando enɛnɛ bɛngi bakɛe asongana na nde; bagamaka bo: «Odjana! Adjongoame moto iyona okɛkɛdea adoe ta kombe e Kumu! Adjongoame iyo odii mokondji o Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndjem 118, 25-26. Ekumu: makomi imi ma mbangi edii na Odjana (boindja Mat 21, 9 ko na nase).</char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu atanea mwana o tito okabee bo ane ko akondaka diko di nde oko mondumba mo balakadea Makomi:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Pɛpɛ bobanga oko, ngando enɛnɛ e Siona!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Indja, mokondji o wɛ adoi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">abaki ta diko di mwana o tito okabee bo ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djkl 9, 9.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Boso mɛnɛ, batingami ba nde baisipoaka mikɔ mi nde; ndelo ebolodja Yesu ekumu, batingami badoalɛdjɛ bo Makomi matɔndɔkɔ modjɔ momina ta tina e nde ko eka ebalaka Makomi tina e nde ekokedjamaka.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Bato basusu ibia badaaka na Yesu ta ehole ebeaka yo Ladjalo aimane ta ikila ko iyana amoimanedja iyo ta tei e bato bago, batubanaka midjɔ miɛnɛ ibo. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ta tina emina, emumu e bato edoa asongana na nde: bato baokaka akɔkɔ embete iyena e bokamodja. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Iboa Bapalisai basabaleana ta tei e bobo: «Oɛnɛkɛdeani obwanitini bokɔ eka emɔti: moto mosusu atingami ngɔngɔ dji nde!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndambo e Bagɛlɛki bahombakadea Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Ndambo e Bagɛlɛki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bagɛlɛki: bato ibia bakɛkɛ ta pasika pɛpɛ bodaa Bayudha, babwanaka bodaa olongo bato bapalaka bikimana modumba mo boangɔnɔ mo Bayudha kaoko ibia bahombaka badhimia Ndjakomba o Bayudha. </char></note> badaaka ta tei e bato ibia badoaka akumea Ndjakomba ta Yelusalɛmɛ ta ehole e tɛkɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Basabatea mbuti na Pilipo, moto o Betesaida ta Galileya, ko babala na nde bo: «Moomi, lodii na posa e boɛnɛ Yesu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Pilipo akɛɛ atondea Andele modjɔ momina, ngɔngɔ djimina ibo basusu babae bakɛɛ atɔndea Yesu modjɔ momina. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Ngonga ebwani esi boimea e bonie Mwana o moto abolodje ekumu. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadeani bo: mbuma emɔti e ble ekadikame oko mbuma emɔti emiti kwa ta kpɔtɔ ko emiti gwa. Endelo ekagwa, edii bobota mbuma djinɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Iyona okapale bomɔ bo nde mɛnɛ amobungedjadea, endelo iyona opali bobungedja bomɔ bo nde iya ta ngondo iye abolodjadea bomɔ bo kɔbili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 10, 39; 16, 25; Mal 8, 35; Luk 9, 35.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Moto akapala bosaleani, asuseni; iboa, mosali o mbi adadea iya ta esika edii mbi. Sesa akumedjadea moto iyona osaleakadeani.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abali tina e yogo e nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Edɛdiye molema mo mbi motungeamakadea. Ko nabale bo? Sesa, otatingoani ta ehole iyee e saya? Endelo nadoa sooti mɛnɛ oko bɛngi naɛnɛ saya emina. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Sesa, pa ekumu ta kombe e wɛ!» Kɔpi emɔti edonga ta busa ebala bo: «Nasia bo ekumedja ehele ko naekumedjadea naikina.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Emumu e bato edaka ena ko eoka kɔpi emina ebabalaka bo: «Yena edaka wɛtoko mogbulumo mo kake!» Bakina babalaka bo: «Andjelu amobalei!» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Endelo Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Kɔpi emina eokamiti tina e mbi, endelo edii tina e bino. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Edɛdiye edii ehole e bosambedja ngondo iye; edɛdiyeye, mokondji o ngondo bamobenganadea. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ko mbi, ehole eangɔdjɔbini bo ta kpɔtɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boangɔdjɔmɔ ta kpɔtɔ edii mobalo momɔti mobalami na mindumba mibae, oko mondumba mokabale Yoane mandɛli mandɛli (boindja 3, 3-8 ko na nase). Einedjakadea iya ndelo ekina boiwea bo Yesu ta ekulusu ko boiwea bo nde ta ekumu (boindja molɔngɔ mo 33; 3, 14-15; 8, 28).</char></note>, natubabi bato basusu ta dii mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Ta mibalo mimina, Yesu ainedjaka mondumba mo yogo egwabi yo. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Emumu e bato bamosɔmbedja bo: «Lookaka ta Mobeko bo Masiya adikamabi kɔbili. Iboa, ndenge ndani ebwani wɛ bobala bo Mwana o moto atungi boiweama? Mwana omina o moto oni?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Bohu bodii oko ta ndanda e bino, endelo tina e moo ehole mokɛkɛ. Medalani ta ehole iye edii ino na bohu, bɛngi bo modidi modae pɛpɛ boimaneani, modjɔ mo moto iyona odalakadea ta modidi tadjebe esika ekɛkɛdea iyo akɛe. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Dhimeani bohu ta ehole edii ino na bu, bɛngi oimeeni bato ba bohu.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Bayudha baloni bodhimea Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Ngɔngɔ dji bobala iboa, Yesu akɛɛ ko abolama bohali na bu. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Nongo akɔɔ iyo bimbete bi bokamodja binɛnɛ ta boso bo bobo, baimodhimeaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Oko iboa eka ebala motɛli Isaya ekokedjami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Kumu, omina odhimea bwɛndi bo biso nda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Omina oinedja Kumu ebɔ ende nda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 53, 1 elangama bobwana na Bibele e gɛlɛki eyou. </char></note>?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Isaya abala pongono bo tina ndani bato ibi baihɔnɔ bodhima bo:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Adipa miso ma bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">apingedja milema mi bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">bɛngi bo miso ma bobo madae pɛpɛ boɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ko milema mi bobo midae pɛpɛ bosipoa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Ko indja tina ndani, bata hombedjakadea milema ta dii mbi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">bɛngi bo nabaheledje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 6, 9-10 elangama ta Bibele e gɛlɛki eyou.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya abala iboa modjɔ mo aɛnɛ ekumu e Yesu ko abalak tina e nde.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ekahia, ta tei e bakondji ba Bayudha ibo bɛɛnɛ, banɛnɛ badhimea Yesu. Endelo, ta tina e Bapalisai, basabombaka, basakaababengana ta ndako e miɔngɔnɔ e Bayudha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 9, 22 </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Bapalaka ekumu edongi ta dii bato endelo te iyena edongi ta dii Ndjakomba.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambi ta ndjea e mibalo mi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu agama bo: «Moto iyona odhimeini, ta bosooti adhimeitini, endelo adhimei iyona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Moto iyona oɛnini, aɛni iyona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mbi, nadoa ta ngondo olongo bohu, bɛngi bo iyona obwani bodhimeani adae pɛpɛ bodikama ta modidi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Moto omɔti akaoka mibalo mi mbi ko adai pɛpɛ bomiisa ta mosala, mbi nitamotitedjadea na ikambo, modjɔ mo nadoa ta tina e boheledja ngondo endelo te ta tina e boedumba na ikambo. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Moto akalonani, ko adhimiti mibalo mi mbi adii bodia ena eka ndani edii bomodumba na ikambo: edii bileho bipa mbi bimodumbabi na ikambo ta busa bo suka. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Modjɔ mo nabaliti na bopala bo mbi mɛnɛ, endelo Sesa olomani iyo mɛnɛ apani eka ebwani na mbi bobala ko boleha. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />ko mbi nadjebakadea bo: mibeko mi nde mikapɛ bomɔ bo kɔbili. Oko boa midjɔ imimi mibakadea mbi, namibalakadea oko mondumba molomani Sesa.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu asosi mako ma batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Tɛkɛ e Pasika eimeaka mbuti. Yesu adjebaka bo ehole eimeaka mbuti tina ende bokina ngondo iye bɛngi akɛe mbuti na Sange ende. Adaka seko apala bato ba nde ibia badaaka ta ngondo ko abapala tee mbunoko ta suka. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu na batingami ba nde bayakaka mia ma mɔkɔmɔkɔ. Djabulu asia bokwea ta molema mo Yudhasi, mwana o Simona Isikaliote, bɛngi atɛke Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu adjebaka iyo mɛnɛ bo adongaka ta dii Ndjakomba ko asɔmbɔdea ta dii Ndjakomba, ko Sange ende amopaka bokondji bosusu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Aangɔɔ ta mesa, aiwa esendja ende e diko ko atomba esendja emɔti iboa asadinga ta bongo. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, aisa madiba ta saani ko abanga bososa mako ma batingami bande ko bomahakoa na esendja emina esadingaka iyo ta bongo. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Iboa aimea yo mbuti na Simona Petelo, iyo abala na nde bo: «Kumu, wɛ ososadea mako ma mbi?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Midjɔ imimi mikɔkɔdea mbi edɛdiyeye wɛ otamidjebakadea, endelo omidjibadea ngɔngɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petelo abala na nde bo: «Ngasa, otasosadea mako ma mbi!» Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Namiti o sosa mako, otadiadea nongo kabo emɔti ta tei e djia dji doi na mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simona Petelo abala na nde bo: «Kumu, ekadaa boa, pɛpɛ bososani otomako, endelo sosani pongono mɔmɔ na molo!» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Moto iyoo osi bosasosa mokuku mosusu, asi boimea mosɛnɔke atungi bososa oto mako. Ino odiini basɛnɔke, endelo te ino basusu.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu adjebaka iyona omokabadea; na tina emina abala bo oka: «Ino basusu oditini basɛnɔke.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobasosa mako, Yesu alwaka esendja e nde, adaa naikina ta mesa ko abala na bu bo: «Osipoini eka esakɔɔni mbi? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Obeakadeanini “Molehi” ko na “Kumu”, odiini na molonga, modjɔ mo adii mbi oko iboa. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Iboa mbi, Kumu ko Molehi mbi naososini mako, ino pongono otungini bososanani mako. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Modjɔ mo naoinedjini eka ebwani na nu bokɔɔ ndenge esakɔɔ mbi tina e bino. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadeani bo: mosali tanɔe moswa nde ko mwana o elomu tanɔe moto iyona omoloma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ milɔngɔ mi 12-16 ko Luk 22.24-27.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Edɛdiye odjebakadeani mɛko mimina; odadeani na sepi okaisadeani midjɔ mimina ta mosala. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Nitabalakadea na nu basusu; nadjebi ibia bahɔɔ mbi. Endelo etungi bo midjɔ mibala Makomi mikokedjame: “Moto iyoo okabanaka na mbi ipa ta saani emɔti ahokoi ta diko di mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 41, 10.</char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Nasi bootɔndeani, boso bo modjɔ momina moimee, bɛngi ehole eimeadea modjɔ momina, odhimeni bo “Mbi nadii”. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Naotɔndeakadeani sooti mɛnɛ bo: moto oasɔdea iyona olomi mbi, aasɔini pongono; ko iyona oasɔdeani, asɔi Iyona olomani.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedji bo Yudhasi amokabadea</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26, 20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mal 14, 17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22, 21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ngɔngɔ dji mɛko mimina, Yesu aoka saya ta molema ko abala na bu bo: «Sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadeani bo: omɔti o bino akabadeani.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Batingami basaindjana, basawadjana bɛngi badjebe moto obalakadea na nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Omɔti o batingami, iyona opalaka Yesu, adaaka adii mbuti na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simona Petelo amonitea, bɛngi awadje Yesu moto obalakadea na nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Motingami omina akukama ta bupa bo Yesu ko amowadja bo: «Kumu, moto omina nda?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Nadubeakadea ekenge e ipa ta mosua: moto opadea mbi ekenge emina, edii iyo iyona.» Iboa Yesu atomba ekenge e ipa, aedubea ko aepa Yudhasi Isikaliote, mwana moomi o Simona. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Ehole ematomba Yudhasi ekenge e ipa, Satana akwea ta tei ende. Yesu abala na nde bo: «Modjɔ mopalakadea wɛ bokɔ, kɔɔ pɛpɛlɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Bato ibia badaaka ta mesa pɛ nongo moto omɔti osipoa tina ebalaka iyo na nde iboa. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Abo Yudhasi adaaka adedja palanga, bakina batingami balɛnɛkɛ bo Yesu amolomaka akɛe asomba leka lobwani bobakamoa ta tɛkɛ, kaoko bokɛ akamoa bakwali. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yudhasi atomba ekenge e ipa ko, na mbala emɔti aimanaka; busa bodipaka.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobeko mo yeene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ngɔngɔ dji Yudhasi boimana, Yesu abala bo: «Edɛdiye Mwana o moto abolodji ekumu, ko Ndjakomba asi bodia ekumu na ndjea ende. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />[Ko edaabo ekumu e Ndjakomba ekainedjama ta tei e nde,] Ndjakomba pongono amokumedjadea iyo mɛnɛ ekumu e Mwana ko ediki mweka bɛngi amopɛ okumu emina. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Bana ba mba, mbi nadii na nu naikina oto moo ehole mokɛkɛ. Ohombadeanini, endelo edɛdiyeye nabalakadea na nu eka ebala mbi na Bayudha: otahɔnɔdeani bokɛɛ iho akɛkɛdea mbi akɛe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 7, 34.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Naopakadeani mobeko moyene: palanani ta tei e bino. Etungi na nu bopalana ta tei e bino modumba moopalani mbi. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Okapalanani ta tei e bino, iboa bato basusu badjebadea bo odini batingami ba mbi.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndei bo Petelo amoinganeadea</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mal 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simona Petelo amowadja bo: «Kumu, okɛkɛdea djɔ?» Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Wɛ otakoka bokimanani ta esika ekɛkɛdea mbi edɛdiyeye, endelo okimanadeani ngɔngɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petelo amowadja naikina bo: «Kumu, tina ebwani na mbi bodaa pɛpɛ bookimana edɛdiyeye nda? Nadii mbuti na bopa bomɔ bombi tina e wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Odii mɛnɛ mbuti na bopa bomɔ bo wɛ tina e mbi? Naotɔndeakadea, sooti mɛnɛ bo: oinganadeani mbala isato boso bo kɔkɔ bobekoa.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu adii ndjea iye edii boimedja ta dii Sesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Pɛpɛ bodaani oko milema diko, dhimeani Ndjakomba, ko dhimeani pongono mbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />A ndako e Sesa bisika bidii binɛnɛ; pɛpɛ boda boa ka naibala na nu bo nakɛɛkɛ abɔngedja esika tinae bino? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ngɔngɔ dji bokɛɛ a obɔngedjeani esika, nasɔmbɔdea ko naotombadeani mbuti na mbi, bɛngi bo ino pongono, odaeni iyana ta esika edii mbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Odjebini ndjea eimedjakadea pamba ekɛkɛdea mbi akɛe.» <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toma amowadja bo: «Kumu, lotadjebakadea esika ekɛkɛ wɛ. Lobwani bodjeba ndjea emina ndenge nda?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Mbi nadii ndjea, bosooti ko na bomɔ. Moto omɔti abwaniti boimea ta dii Sesa amiti nɔɔ na ndjea e mba. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Okadjebani mbi, odjebadeani pongono Sesa. Ko edɛdiyeye, omodjebini, omoɛnini.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Pilipo abala na nde bo: «Kumu, looinedja Sesa ko lotadaadea na posa eka ekina.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Ekoka edaa mbi nu ko wɛ opakina djebani oko, Pilipo? Moto iyona oɛnɛni aɛnɛ Sesa. Tina ndani obalakadea bo: “Loinedja Sesa”? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Otadhimakadea bo mbi nadii ta tei e Sesa ko Sesa adii ta tei mbi? Mibalo mibalakadea mbi na nu te midonge ta dii mbi mɛnɛ. Edii wɛteko Sesa iyoo odii ta tei e mbi akokedjakadea mikɔ mi nde iyo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Dhimeanini: mbi nadii ta tei e Sesa ko Sesa adii ta tei e mba. Ko naikina, dhimani ta tina e mikɔ mimina. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Naotɔndeakadea, sooti mɛnɛ bo: iyo odhimeini, akɔdea pongono mikɔ mikɔkɔdea mbi. Amikɔdea kutu na bonɔ, modjɔmo nakɛkɛdea ta dii Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Ko mbi nakɔdea midjɔ misusu miwadjakabi ino na kombe e mbi, bɛngi Sange moto adie ekumu ta tei e Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Okawadjanini eka emɔti na kombe e mbi, naekɔbi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuno e boloma Mwembo Mosɛnoke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Ekadaa bo opalakadeanini, osumadeani mibeko mi mbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nasɛngɛdea ta dii Sesa aopɛni Mbaeli bɛngi adae aokamoani, ko adikame na nu seko: <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />edii Mwembo mo bosooti. Ngondo ebwaniti bomoasɔ, modjɔ mo ngondo ebwaniti bomoɛnɛ ko bomodjeba. Endelo ino, omodjebakadeani, modjɔ mo akadikame na nu ko adadea na nu seko. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Nataokinakani ino bɛnɛ ondingo bana ba malike; nasɔmbɔdea ta dii ino. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole mokɛkɛ ngondo etaɛnɛdeani naikina, endelo ino, oɛnɛdeanini modjɔ mo nahelamakadea ko ino ohelamadeani pongono. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Ta busa bomina ibua osipoabini bo mbi nadi atei e Sesa, ko ino ta tei e mbi ko mbi ta tei e bino.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />«Moto akabanea mibeko mi mbi ko akamisuma, indja moto okapaleni. Sesa apaladea moto okapaleni; mbi pongono namopaladea ko nasaɛnɛmedjadea na nde.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yudhe, endelo te Yudhasi Isikaliote, abala na nde bo: «Kumu, ndenge ndani ebwani bokɔɔmɔ bo otungi bosaɛnɛmedja oto na su pɛ ko odae pɛ bosaɛnɛmedja na ngondo?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Moto opalakadeani asumadea eka ebalakadea mbi. Sesa amopaladea; lodoadea ta dii iyo mbi na Sesa, ko lodikamadea ta dii iyo. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Moto iyo okadae pɛpɛ bopalani ta sume mibalo mi mbi. Mɛko imimi miokakadea ino nabala mitadongakadea ta dii mbi, endelo midongakadea ta dii Sesa iyona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Naotɔndeini mɛko mimina ta ehole eye edii mbi nanu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Mbaeli iyona odoadea aokamoani, Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, imua molomadea Sesa na kombe e mbi, moolehadeani midjɔ misusu ko aolɛdjedjadeani mɛko misusu mibala mbi na nu.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />«Naokineakadeani bogo, naopakadeani bogo bombi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 9, 5.</char></note>, nataboopakadeani mondumba mokapɛ bato ba ngondo. Pɛpɛ bodainioko milema diko, pɛpɛ bobangani <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Ookakinini nabala bo: “Nakɛi, endelo nasɔmbɔdea adii no.” Okapalanini, ino osepakini bodjeba bo nakɛi ta dii Sesa, modjɔ mo Sesa anɔini na bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Naotɔndeini modjɔ momina edɛdiyeye, boso bo mɛko mimina mi imee, bɛngi bo ehole eimeadea mo, odhimeni. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Natabaladea na nu naikina bobuke, modjɔ mo mokondji o ngondo iye akɛkɛdea adoe. Adiiti nongo na bokondji bomɔti diko di mbi, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />endelo etungi na ngondo bodjeba bo nakapale Sesa ko nakakɔe oko mondumba molomani iyo. Angɔni lodonge iya!»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu adii mole mo vino mopele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«Mbi nadii mole mo vino mopele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 5, 1-4.</char></note> ko Sesa adii moswa gbie. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Aka dongedja etape e mbi esusu, ekadae pɛpɛ bobota mbuma endelo iyena ekabote mbuma, akaesose, bɛngi bo ebote naikina mbuma djinɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />bileho djiolehani mbi djisia boososani ehele. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Dikamani ta tei e mbi, oko mondumba mo dii mbi ta tei e nu. Etape ebwaniti bobota mbuma iyo mɛnɛ emiti tingama na mole mo vino; ndenge emɔti na nu obwanitini bobota mbuma ehole edaino pɛpɛ botingama na mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Mbi nadii mole mo vino, ino bitape. Moto iyo odikamadea engbanga emɔti na mbi, ko iyoo otingi mbi nande, abotadea mbuma djinɛnɛ, modjɔ mo obwanitini bokɔɔ eka emɔti pɛ mbi <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Moto iyona odai pɛpɛ bo bodikama na mbi adii modumbamake sokolu ko akakanadea; bitape djikakanake baka dji andoe, baka bidumbe ta mosa ko biangoi. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Okadikadikamani na mbi ko mibalo mimbi mikada atei e bino, wadjani eka esusu epalakadea ino ko oediadeani. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Indja ndenge ndani eka ɛnɛme ekumu e Sesa ehole e bo obotini mbuma djinɛnɛ ko okasainedjani bo odini batingami ba mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nakaopaleni oko ndenge ekapaleni Sesa. Dikani ta tei e epaeli e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Okasumani mibeko mi mbi, odikamadeani ta tei e epaeli e mbi, oko mondumba mokasume mbi mibeko mi Sesa, ko nakadikame ta tei e epaeli ende.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />«Nabali iboa bɛngi bo sepi embi edae ta tei e bino ko olumeni na sepi enɔɔke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Isa 9, 2; 35, 10. </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />indjani mobeko mombi: Palanani ta tei e bino oko mondumba mokaopaleni mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Bwela mɛɛnɛ bonɛnɛ bobwani moto boinedja bopa bomɔ bonde ta tina e babinande. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Odiini bina mbi oko okakɔɔni midjɔ miolomakadeani mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nataobeakadeani naikina basali, modjɔmo mosali tadjebe midjɔ mikakɔe moswande. Naobeakadeani binambi, modjɔ mo nasi booinedjani midjɔ misusu miikoa mbi ta dii Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ino oihɔni mbi, endelo mbi moto oohɔɔni; ko naolomani, okɛeni, abota mbuma ko dji boyeyoa. Midjɔ misusu miowadjabi ino adii Sesa na kombe e mbi, aopabini. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Eka eolomakadeani mbi edii opalaneni ino na ino.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngondo eloni Yesu ko na bato ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Ngondo ekadaa na elone na nu, djebakani bo elonani boso bo bino. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Osoodaani bato ba ngondo, ka ngondo eopalini modjɔ mo odiini bato ba yu. Endelo mbi naohɔɔni ko naimanedjini ta ngondo ko odiitini bato ba ngondo tina emina ngondo eolonakadeani. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Lɛdjɛni mɛko miotɔndeakini mbi: “Mosali tanɔe moswa nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 10, 24; Luk 6, 40; Yoa 13, 16.</char></note>.” Oko modumba mo nɔngedjani ibo, baonyokɔlɔbini pongono oko boa; mondumba modaa bo pɛ bosuma bileho bi mbi, batasumabi pongono bileho bi bino. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Endelo baokɔɔbini midjɔ imia misusu ta tina e mbi, modjɔ mo batadjebakadea moto iyona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Babwanaki boingana pekato dji bobo naso nadaa pɛpɛ bodoa ko naso na daa pɛpɛ bo babalea. Endelo edɛdiyeye babwaniti boingana pekato dji bobo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Iyona okaokeini swɛ, akaokee pongono Sesa swɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Babwanaki bodaa pɛpɛ boingana pekato dji bobo esoodaa nadae pɛpɛ bokɔ misala mi daa moto okina pɛpɛ bokɔ. Enakoboa edɛdiyeyee, baɛni misala mi mbi ko baokeini swɛ, na Sesa pongono. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Endelo ekɔmɔkɔdea boa bɛngi mɛko mikomama ta mobeko mi bobo mikokedjame: “Baokeini swɛ oko ngasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 35, 19; 69, 5.</char></note>.”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Moto iyona adoadea aokamoani: edii Mwembo mo bosooti modongadea ta dii Sesa. Naolomeadeani bodonga ta dii Sesa ko abaladea tati e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ino pongono, obaladeani tati e mbi, modjɔ mo odaani na mbi donga oko ta mbangi.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«Mbi nabali na nu midjɔ imia bɛngi odaeni pɛpɛ bodumbani edhimeli. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Baobenganabini ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha. Ko na nongo ehole ekɛkɛdea adoe, bato ibia baowadeani balɛdjɛbi bo basaleakadea Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bakɔɔdea boa modjɔ mo batadjebakadea Sesa, batadjebakadea pongono mbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Endelo mbi naotɔndeini modjɔ momina bɛngi, ehole iemeabi ndelo emine, alɛdjenibini bo nasia botɔndeani ehele.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Mosala mo Mwembo Mosɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Naiotɔndeani midjɔ mimina ta mbangi, modjɔ mo nadaaka na nu. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Edɛdiye mbi nakɛkɛdeakɛe ta dii yona olomani, ko pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti ta ndanda e bino owadjakadeani bo: “Okɛi djɔ?” <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Endelo olumini na ndjokwa ta milema mi bino modjɔ mo nabali na nu iboa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Iboa naotɔndekadeani sooti bo: edii bopele mbi nakɛe ta elɔkeebino; modjɔ mo namiti kɛɛ, Mbaeli iyona odoadea aokamoani abwaniti bodoa ta dii ino. Endelo nakɛkɛdeae akɛe namolomadea ta dii ino. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ko ehole adoadea iyo, ainedjadea bato ba ngondo iye ibunga di bobo ta modjɔ moindji pekato, bodju ko na sambi e Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 24, 25.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ta tina etingi na pekato edii bo: batadhimeakadeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 8, 21-24; 9, 41; 15, 22-24.</char></note>; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />ta tina etingi na bodju edii: nakɛi ta dii Sesa ko otaɛnɛdeanini naikina; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />ta tina etingi na sambi, epalakadea bobala bo: mokondji o ngondo iye asia bosamba ehele.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Nadii naikina na midjɔ minɛnɛ mi bootɔndeani, endelo otamihɔnɔni edɛdiyeye. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ehole edodea Mwembo mo bosooti, aodaledjadeani na bosooti bosusu. Atabaladea na kombe ende iyo mɛnɛ, endelo abaladea mɛko misusu miokabi iyo ko aodjebedeani midjɔ mikɛkɛdea adoe. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Iyo ainedjadea ekumu e mbi, modjɔ mo abolodjadea midjɔ midii ta dii mbi ko amiodjebedjadeani. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Midjɔ misusu mipeli Sesa midii pongono ta dii mbi. Na tina emina nabali bo adiadea mɛko misusu midii ta dii mbi ko amiotɔndeadeani.»<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjokwa ehombanadea mongandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />«Ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole mokɛkɛ otaɛnɛdeanini, ko ngɔngɔ oɛnɛdeanini naikina.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ndambo ekina ta tei e batingami ba nde basabaleaka bo: «Eka iye epalakadea botingodja bo? Alotɔndeakadea bo: “Ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole mokɛkɛ otaɛnɛdeanini, ko ngɔngɔ oɛnɛdeanini”, ko naikina: “Modjɔ mo nakɛkɛdea akɛe ta dii Sesa”. <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Etingodjakadea “moo ehole iyo mokɛkɛ” obalakadea iyo nde? Lotasipoakadea eka epalakadea iyo bobala.» <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu adjeba bo badaaka na posa e bomowadja. Iboa abala na bu ibo: «Naotɔndeakini bo “Ngɔngɔ dji moo ehole mkɛkɛ otaɛnɛdeanini naikina, ko ngɔngɔ djimina oɛnɛdeanini naikina.” Osawadjakadeani mawadja ta tei ebino tina e modjɔ momina: “Ediki mweka oɛnɛtebinini, ngɔngɔ dji ehole ekɛkɛ, onɛbinini naikina.” Osawadjanakadeani ta tina e modjɔ momina? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Oko iboa, naotɔndeakadeani, sooti mɛnɛ bo: oyeadeani ko osayeanadeani, enakoboa ngondo esepadea; odadeani na saya, endelo ndjokwa e bino ehombanadea mongandi. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Ehole ekahombe mwali abote mwana, akaoke bokɛsɛdji modjɔ mo ndelo ende e booka saya eimei; endelo ehole ebotami mwana, mwali akabose saya djimina djisusu tina e bo moto abotami ta ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Ino pongono edɛdiyeye odiini na ndjokwa. Endelo nadoadea aoindjani naikina, iboa milema mi bino misepadea, ko sepi e ino, pɛpɛ nongo moto omɔti obwani boekatowa.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />«Busa bomina bokaimeadea, otawadjadeanini nongo modjɔ momɔti. Okoboa sooti mɛnɛ, naotɔndeakadeani bo: Sesa aopadeani eka esusu e mowadjabi ino na kombe e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mbunoko edɛdiyeye, opakina wadjani eka emɔti na kombe e mbi. Wadjani ko obolodjadeani, ko mongandi mo bino modaadea molumake.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu molongi o ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Mbi naotɔndeakadeani midjɔ imi misusu na bikuanedji. Ta ehole ekɛkɛdea adoe nitabaladea na nu mɛko mondumba imu, endelo ehole emina naotɔndeadeani na bohu mɛko mi Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Ta busa bomina ibua, oangɔnɔbini Sesa na kombe e mbi; ko naotɔndeitini bo na moangɔnɔbi tina e bino, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Modjɔmo Sesa iyo mɛnɛ akaopaleni. Akaopaleni modjɔ mo ino okapalenini ko okadhimeni bo nadonga ta dii Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Mbi nadonga ta dii Sesa ko naso naimea ta ngondo. Edɛdiye nakinakadea ngondo ko nasɔmbɔkɔdea ta dii Sesa.» <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Iboa, batingami bande babala na nde bo: «Indja edɛdiyeye obalakadea na bohu ko na pɛpɛ bobala na bikuanedji. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Edɛdiye lodjebi bo wɛ odjebakadea mɛko misusu ko odiiti na posa e bo baowadje mawadja. Na tina emina iso lodhimi bo odonga ta dii Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Odhimini edɛdiyeye? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Indjani, ehole ekɛkɛdea adoe ko esi boimea iyena enanganadea ino basusu moto na moto ayanadea ta dii iyo ko okinadeanini mbi buki. Ngasa, nadiiti mɛnɛ mbi buki, modjɔ mo Sesa adii na mbi engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Naotɔndeini midjɔ imia misusu bɛngi odɛeni bogo na bodaa na mbi engbanga. Odideani minɔngɔ ta ngondo. Endelo daani na ingbangba! Mbi nalonga ngondo!»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aangɔni tina e batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji bobala iboa, Yesu angɔdjɔ miso ta odiko ko aangɔnɔ bo: «Sesa, ehole eimei. Inedja ekumu e Mwana owɛ, bɛngi bo Mwana ainedje pongono ekumu e wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Omopa bokondji diko di bato basusu, bɛngi bo apɛ bomɔ bo kɔbili ta dii ibia bamopa wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Bomɔ bo kɔbili bodii wɛtoko bodjeba wɛ, Ndjakomba omɔti ko o sooti, ko bodjeba Yesu Kilito, iyona oloma wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nainedja ekumu e wɛ ta kpɔtɔ; ko nasiedji mosala mopani wɛ nakɔe. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Iboa edɛdiyeye, Sesa, pani ta boso bo wɛ ekumu iyena edaka na mbi boso bo ngondo ekɔɔme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 1, 1-2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Nadjebedji kombe ewɛ ta dii bato ibia batomba wɛ ta ngondo mbunoko obapani. Badaaka bato ba wɛ, obapani ko basuma mobalo mo wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Edɛdiye mɛnɛ badjebi bo mɛko misusu miipani wɛ midonga ta dii wɛ, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />modjɔ mo nabapa mibalo mipani wɛ, ko bamiasɔɔ. Badjeba bo mbi mɛnɛ nadonga ta dii wɛ ko badhima bo olomani.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />«Naangɔnɔkɔ tina e bobo. Nitangɔnɔkɔdea tina e ngondo, endelo ta tina e ibia bapani wɛ, modjɔ mo badii ba wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Eka esusu e dii na mbi edii e wɛ ko eka esusu edii na wɛ edii e mbi; ko ekumu e mbi einedjami ta dii ibo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Nadiiti naikina ta ngondo, endelo ibo badii ta ngondo; mbi nakɛkɛakɛe ta adii wɛ. Sesa o mosɛnɔke, babanea na kombe e wɛ, kombe epani wɛ, bɛngi badae omɔti ondingo mbi nasa wɛ ndenge edii mbi nasa wɛ omɔti. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ehole edaka mbi na bu, nababaneaka oko na ngulu e kombe e wɛ, iyena epani wɛ. Nababaneaki ko pɛpɛ nongo omɔti o bobo obunga, dongedja oko iyona obwanaka na bobunga, bɛngi Ikomi ikokedjame. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Ko edɛdiyeye nakɛkɛdea ta dii wɛ. Nabalakadea iboa ta ehole iye edii mbi oko ta ngondo, bɛngi badie ta tei e bobo bɛnɛ mongandi mo mbi mosusu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mbi nabapi mobalo mo wɛ ko ngondo ebaokea swɛ, modjɔ mo badiiti bato ba ngondo oko ondingo mbi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nitaoangɔnɔkɔdea bɛngi bo obadongedjeni ta ngondo, endelo bɛngi obabanee badae pɛpɛ bokwa ta midjɔ Mibe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 6, 13.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Badiiti bato ba ngondo, na mbi pongono nadiiti moto o ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Badjongoa baimee bato ba wɛ mɛnɛ, ta ndjea e bosooti; mobalo mo wɛ modii sooti. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Nabaloma ta ngondo oko mondumba moma wɛ lomani ta ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nasapakadea ta dii wɛ tina e bobo, bɛngi ibo pongono badjongoame mɛnɛ na bosooti.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />«Nataoangɔnɔkɔdea oto tina e bobo, endelo tina e bato ibia badhimeadeani pongono na ndjea e mobalo mo bobo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Naoangɔnɔkɔdea bɛngi ibo basusu badae omɔti. Sesa, badae baputoanake na su, mondumba moputoana wɛ na ko mbi. Badae omɔti bɛngi ngondo edhime bo olomani. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nabapi ekumu epani wɛ, bɛngi badae omɔti mondumba modii mbi na wɛ moto omɔti. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Mbi ta tei e bobo ko wɛ ta tei e mbi; iyena edii mwɛngi mobwani na bu bodaa mɛnɛ omɔti, bɛngi ngondo edjebe naikina bo olomani ko okabapale oko mondumba mokapaleni wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Sesa, obapani ko napalakadea bo badae na mbi engbanga iho ta dii mbi, bɛngi baɛnɛ ekumu e mbi, iyena epani wɛ modjɔ mo opalani boso bo ngondo ekɔɔme. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Sesa o bodju, ngondo eiodjeba, endelo mbi naodjeba ko bato ibi badjeba bo olomani. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nasia bobadjebedja kombe e wɛ ko nabadjebedjadea naikina, bɛngi bo epaeli edii na wɛ ta dii mbi edae ta dii ibo ko bɛngi bo mbi mɛnɛ nadae ta tei e bobo.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bapei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mal 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ngɔngɔ dji boangɔnɔ iboa, Yesu akɛɛ na batingami bande ta ngunda ediba ekabee bo Cedoloni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mal 11, 1 ko na nase.</char></note>. Edaka na gbie emɔti ena ekwea iyo na batingami bande. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yudhasi, moto iyona omotɛkɛkɛ, adjebaka pongono esika emina, modjɔ mo Yesu na batingami bande badoaka engbanga ta esika emina mandɛli mandɛli. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Iboa Yudhasi akɛɛ ta gbie, engbanga emɔti na basoda ko na sindjili baloma banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na iputo di Bapalisai; bapeaka milodji, milinda ko na mindoki. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu adjebaka midjɔ misusu imi mimotaneadea asalinda mbuti na bu ko abawadja bo: «Ohombakadeano nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Ibo bamosɔmbedja bo: «Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ.» Yesu abala na bu bo: «Edii mbi.» Ko Yudhasi moto iyona otɛkɛ Yesu ta dii ibo, aemaka pongono ena engbanga emɔti na bu. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ehole ebala Yesu na bu bo: «Edii mbi», basɔmbɔ ngɔngɔ ko bakwa ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu abawadja naikina bo: «Ohombakadea ino nda?» Basɔmbedja bo: «Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu abasɔmbedja bo: «Naotɔndeini ehele bo, edii mbi. ekada bo ohombakadeani mbi kinani bato bakina bakɛe.» <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Abala iboa bɛngi akokedje mobalo mobala iyo bo: «Nabungedjiti nongo omɔti o bato bapani wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 6, 39; 17, 12.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simona Petelo adaaka na mɔmbi; iboa amoiwa, ko akwɛlɛ mosali o nganga o ndjakomba o monɛnɛ ko aso amolena itoi di ebɔ e baami. Mosali omina kombe e nde Malikusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Endelo Yesu abala na Petelo bo: «Sɔmbedja mɔmbi ta igbogbo di mu. Wɛ olɛnɛkɛdea bo mbi nitamwakadea kɔbɔ e saya eepani Sesa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 26, 39; Mal 14, 36; Luk 22, 42.</char></note>?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakɛi na Yesu boso bo Ane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Molɔlɔ mo basoda na mokondji o bobo ko na basindjili ba bakondji ba Bayudha bapea Yesu ko bamonanga mbɔti.<verse eid="JHN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bakɛɛ na nde boso mɛnɛ ta dii Ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ane: boindja Luk 3, 2 ko na nase.</char></note>. Ane adaaka bokio bo Kaipa iyoo odaaka nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ ta yanga iyena. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Enakoboa edii Kaipa moto opa ilako ta dii bakondji ba Bayudha bo: «Edii bopele bo moto omɔti agwɛ tina e bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 11, 49-50.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo aingani bo aditi motingami o Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26, 69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mal 14, 66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22, 55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simona Petelo na okina motingami bakimanaka Yesu. Motingami iyona okina adjebanaka na nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ, na tina emina akwea na Yesu engbanga ta tei e opango bo nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Endelo Petelo adikaka sokolu, mbuti na monɔkɔ mo ndako. Iboa motingami iyona okina, o djebanaka na nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ, aimana ko abala na mwali iyona o baneaka modipe mo ndako, ko aso akwedja Petelo. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mosali mwali iyona o baneaka modipe mo ndako abala na Petelo bo: «Wɛ odiiti pongono omɔti o batingami ba moto omina?» Petelo asɔmbedja bo: «Ngasa te mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Piɔ a ekɔɔ; na tina emina basali na basindjili balanedjaka mosa, badaaka bahiki mosa ko bamooka. Petelo pongono adaaka ta tei e bobo aoka mosa.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ awadji Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26, 59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mal 14, 55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22, 66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Iboa nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ awadja Yesu ta tina e batingami ba nde ko ta tina e bileho bipaka iyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Mbi nadaakabi nabala ta miso ma bato basusu; ko nalehaka ta ndako dji miɔngɔnɔ dji Bayudha ko na ta tepelo, ta esika ekaputoine Bayudha basusu; naibalakabi na mbombi. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Tina ewadjakadeani na wɛ nda? Wadja bato ibibi baokabi midjɔ mibalakaki mbi na bu: badjebakadea bopele mɛnɛ eka ndani ebalakabi mbi na bu.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ehole emabala Yesu iboa, sindjli omɔti yona odaaka ena aboma Yesu epapata abala bo: «Osɔmbedjakadea nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ iboa?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Nakabala eka emɔti ebe, inedja bobe bomina; endelo ekadaa eka esabala mbi edii sooti, tina esabomani na wɛ nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Iboa Ana aloma Yesu oko atingi na mbɔti ta dii Kaipa, nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo ainganei naikina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26, 71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mal 14, 69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22, 58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ta ehole emina iyena, Simona Petelo adaaka ena aoka mosa. Bamowadja bo: «Wɛ odiiti pongono omɔti o batingami ba moto oyo?» Endelo Petelo aingana ko abala bo: «Ngasa, nadiiti motingami o nde.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Omɔti o basali ba nganga o Ndjakomba o monɛnɛ, odaaka bwela bo moto iyona olenaka Petelo itoi, abala na nde bo: «Mbi naonɛkiti wɛ na nde ta gbie?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Endelo Petelo amoinganea naikina.Ko oko ta ehole emina yena kɔkɔ moomi abekoa.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso bo Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mal 15, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Ngɔngɔ djimina edaka ehuma mɛnɛ batomba Yesu ta dii Kaipa ko bakɛɛ na nde ta ndako e gupɛlɛnɛlɛ odaaka moto o Loma. Endelo bato ibia bakɛɛ na nde baikwea ta ndako basakaimea na pita ko basakadaa pɛ boyaka mia ma Pasika. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ta tina emina gupɛlɛnɛlɛ Pilato adoa abatanea sokolu. Abawadja bo: «Tina epundakadea na nu moto iyo nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Aso adaa pɛpɛ bodaa moto mobe, lobwanakiti bodoa na nde aokabea.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato abala na bu bo: «Motombani ino bɛnɛ ko mosambedjani bobwana na mibeko mi bino.» Bayudha bamosɔmbedja bo: «Iso lodiiti na bokondji bo boowa moto.»<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Iyena edii mondumba mo bokokedja bo kɔpi ebala Yesu ta tina e yogo egwadea iyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 3, 14; 12, 32 ko na nase.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Iboa Pilato akwea na ikina ta ndako e gupɛlɛnɛlɛ; Abea Yesu ko amowadja bo: «Wɛ odii mokondji o Bayudha?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Obali boa modjɔ mo olɛdji wɛ mɛnɛ kaoko bato bakina baotɔndei iboa tina e mbi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato amosɔmbedja bo: «Edii mbi ko Moyudha? Bato ba ekomi e wɛ mɛnɛ ko na banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ baokabi iya ta dii mbi; ekɔi wɛ mɛnɛ nde?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Bokumu bo mbi boditi bo ngodo iye; bokumu bo mbi boso bodaa bo ngondo iye, ka basali ba mbi baani tina e bosia bo badae pɛpɛ bokabani ta mɔmɔ ma bakondji ba Bayudha. Endelo, bokumu bo mbi bodiiti bo iya nase.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Iboa Pilato abala nande bo: «Odii mɛnɛ mokondji?» Yesu asɔmbedja bo: «Wɛ moto osabala bo nadii mokondji. Nabotama ko nadoa ta ngondo tina e bopa tati tina e bosooti. Moto obwani bodaa ta bosooti adii booka mɛko imi mibalakedea mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato amowadja bo: «Bosooti eka nda?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu atitedjami ta yogo</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27, 15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mal 15, 6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ngɔngɔ dji meko mimina Pilato akɛɛ atanea naikina Bayudha o sokolu. Abala na bu bo: «Nataɛnɛkɛdea modjɔ mobwani na su botitedja moto iyo ta yogo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Endelo bobwana na momɛsɛno mo bino nakaoimanedjeeni aengi ndelo moto o bɔlɔkɔ omɔti ta tɛkɛ e Pasika. Opalakadeani bo naoimanedjeni mokondji o Bayudha?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Ibo bamosɔmbedja ko bagama bo: «Ngasa, te iyo! Opalakadea iso Balabasi!» Enakoboa, Balabasi adaaka motɔmbɔki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 3, 14.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Iboa Pilato apa ndjea bo batombe Yesu ko bamokɛsɛkɛke mbalake. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Basoda bayoa isuku di ndjubɛ ko baloadja Yesu ta molo ko bamoloadja pongono mokoto mokpetu. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Babatamaka mbuti na nde ko babalaka bo: «Mokondji o Bayudha bwandae!» Ko bamobomaka bipapata. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato aimana naikina ko abala na Bayudha bo: «Hokamedjani naolwɛkɛdeani moto omina iyaya osokolu bɛngi odjebeni bo mbi naɛniti nongo modjɔ mɔti mobwani bomotitedja na ikambo.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Iboa Yesu aimana; alwaka isuku di ndjubɛ ko na mokoto mokpetu. Ko Pilato abala na bu bo: «Moto omina iyona!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Endelo ehole emoɛnɛ banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ ko na basindjili baso bagama bo: «Mobaka ta ekulusu! Mobaka ta ekulusu!» Pilato abasɔmbedja bo: «Kɛamobakeni ta ekulusu ino bɛɛnɛ, modjɔ mo mbi nitaɛnɛkɛdea modjɔ mɛɛnɛ mobwani bo motitedja ta ikambo.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Bayudha bamosɔmbedja bo: «Iso lodii na mobeko momɔti, ko bobwana na mobeko momina etungi na nde bogwa, modjɔ mo asatukoa bo adii Mwana o Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Lew 24, 16.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ehole eoka Pilato mibalo mi mina aoka naikina bɔɔ na bonɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Akwea naikina ta ndako e gupɛlɛnɛlɛ ko awadja Yesu bo: «Wɛ odongi djɔ?» Endelo Yesu aimosɔmbedja. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato abala nande ibo: «Otapalakadea bosɔmbedjani? Otadjebaka bonie mbi nadii na bokondji bo botingoa ko pongono boobakedja ta ekulusu?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Odiiti na bokondji bomɔti ta diko di mbi dongedja oko bokondji ibua bodongi ta busa. Na tina emina, moto osakabani tadii wɛ isumu di nde dinɔi di wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Bobanga oko ta ehole emina, ahombaka mwɛngi mo botingoa Yesu. Endelo Bayudha babanga ogama bo: «Okatingoa moto omina, odiiti na ikina mwange Kaisala! Moto mosusu iyona osatukoakadea bo adii mokondji, adii moloni o Kaisala!» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ehole eoka Pilato kɔpi djimina, aimanedja Yesu sokolu; adaa ta kiti ekataka iyo makambo e beyaka bo polo e anda bo mabanga bakaebee na monɔkɔ mo alameɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gabata: kombe e monɔkɔ mo alameɛ etingodjakadea esika emɔti e diko.</char></note> «Gabata». <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Edaka busa bo Mosɛlingo mo Pasika, ta ehole e midi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edaka ta ngonga e midi, busa ibua bokaba bo bana ba bhata, ta tepelo ta tina e mia ma Pasika.</char></note>. Pilato abala na Bayudha bo: «Indjani mokondji o bino iyo!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Endelo ibo basusu bagama bo: «Agwɛ! Agwɛ! Mobakani ta ekulusu!» Pilato abala na bu ibo: «Nabakee mokondji o bino ta ekulusu?» Bakondji ba bonganga ba Ndjakomba basɔmbedja bo: «Iso lodiiti na okina mokondji, o biso omɔti oko Kaisala.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Iboa Pilato abapa Yesu, bɛngi bamobake ta ekulusu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mal 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Baso batomba Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu atomba yo mɛnɛ ekulusu ende aimana ta ngando enɛnɛ akɛɛ ta esika ebeyaka bo na kombe e Gologota ta monɔkɔ mo alameɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gologota: kombe e monɔkɔ mo alameɛ etingodjakadea Engɔngɔlɔ e molo. Edaka moo ngomba omɔti edaka mbuti na ngando enɛnɛ.</char></note> esika e «Engɔngɔlɔ e molo». <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Iyena edii esika e baka bo Yesu ta ekulusu. Oko ta ehole emina, babaka bakina bato baami babae ta ekulusu omɔti ngambo, okina ngambo ko Yesu iyo mɛnɛ adaaka ndanda. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato apa pongono ndjea bakome ikomi dimɔti ko badibake ta ekulusu; ikomi dimina dibalaka bo: «Yesu o Nadjalɛtɛ, mokondji o Bayudha.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bayudha banɛnɛ balanga ikomi dimina, modjɔ mo esika ebakaka bo Yesu ta ekulusu edaka mbuti na ngando ɛnɛnɛ, ko ikomi dimina idaka na monɔkɔ mo Baebele, na latɛ ko na gɛlɛki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Iboa banganga ba Ndjakomba banɛnɛnɛnɛ babala na Pilato bo: «Obwaniti bokoma “mokondji o Bayudha” endelo obwani bokoma wɛtoko bo: “Moto asasatukoa bo: Nadii mokondji o Bayudha.”» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato asɔmbedja bo: «Modjɔ mokomi mbi modikami oko mondumba mokomi mbi.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ehole esidja basoda bobaka Yesu ta ekulusu, batomba bisendja bi nde ko babikabana na mabondo manɛi, engi soda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mobeko mo Baloma mopaka ndjea ta dii bato ibia bakaowoe bato batombe bibembe bi babɔlɔkɔ.</char></note> na inde ibondo. Batomba naikina mokoto mo nde, mokoto momina moitongama na bipasa dji bisendja, motongamaka oto na esendja emɔti banga o diko mbunoko nase. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Basoda basasabaleana bo: «Lotalakadea mokoto imu, endelo lobome djeke bɛngi lodje moto omotombadea.» Ekɔmɔkɔ oko mondumba mokoma bo ta Makomi bo: «Bakabana bisendja bi mbi ko baboma mokoto mo mbi djeke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjem 22, 19.</char></note>.» Basoda bakɔɔ oko iboa.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Indja bato baemaka mbuti na ekulusu e Yesu: Nange ende, mwange nango, Malia, mwali o Kolopasi ko na Malia o ngando e Magadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu aɛnɛ nange ende ko na motingami opalaka iyo aemi mbuti na nango. Abala na nango bo: «Mwali, indja mwana o wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Ngɔngɔ djimina abala na motingami omina bo: «Indja nange ewɛ.» Oko ta ehole emina, motingami omina amotomba ta dii iyo.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yogo e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mal 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, abo Yesu adjebaka bo edɛdiyeye, midjɔ misusu midaka mikokedjamake, abala bɛngi akokedje Ikomi abala bo: «Naoki posa e madiba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndjem 69, 22.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Edaaka na egbogolo emɔti ena elumake na vino e ngai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Ndjem 69, 22.</char></note>. Basodha badubea imbusu ta vino emina, bainanga ta sɔngɔ e etape e idjɔpe ko balinda mbuti na monɔkɔ mo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu amwaka mana ma ngai ngɔngɔ abala bo: «Modjɔ misusu mikokedjami!» Iboa adumba molo ko agwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soda omɔti alusi mopandje mo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Edaka busa bo Mosɛlingo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 27, 62 ko na nase.</char></note> mo sabata, bakondji ba Bayudha baipalaka bibembe bidikame bibaki ta ekulusu mbunoko ta ehole e sabata, ta modjɔ mo bo sabata emina edaka na tɛtɔ enɛnɛ; iboa bawadja Pilato apɛ ndjea e bobuka mako ma bato babakamaka ta bikulusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baipalaka sabata: boindja Dit 21.22-23. bobuka mako ma bato babakaka bo ta ekulusu: bato babaka ibo babananga mɔmɔ boso bo bagwɛ badika ndoko ehole eyai. Bababuka mako, babasia badae pɛpɛ bodia ekamweli ko babaowa pɛpɛlɛ.</char></note> ko bobakoa bibembe dji bobo ta bikulusu. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Iboa basoda badoa, ababukaka mako ma moto o boso o baka bo ta ekulusu na Yesu pongono, ngɔngɔ djimina iyona o babae. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ehole eimea bo ta dii Yesu batanea amasia bogwa ta tina emina baimobukaka mako. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Endelo soda omɔti ta tei e basoda amolusa mopandje na ikɔngɔ ko a mbuku makiya na madiba nakɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Moto iyona oɛnɛ midjɔ mimina amiɛnɛ, ko tati e nde edii sooti; iyo adjebakadea bo abalakadea bosooti. Atɔndeakadea tati emina bɛngi ino pongono odhimeni. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Na tina emina, mobalo mo Ikomi ididi mokokedjami: «Bamobuketebi nongo mokua momɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Boi 12, 46; Mits 9, 12; Ndjem 34, 21.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ko ta ikina Ikomi ibala bo: «Baindjabi moto iyona olusa bo mopandje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djkl 12, 10.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baisi Yesu ta ikila</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mal 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ngɔngɔ djimina Yosepu moto o ngando e Alimate awadja Pilato ndjea e botomba ebembe e Yesu. Yosepu adaaka motingami o Yesu ta mbombi modjɔ mo abangaka bakondji ba Bayudha ko Pilato aso amopa ndjea. Yosepu aso akɛɛ atomba ebembe e Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodɛmɛ moto iyona okɛɛkɛ mbala emɔti ta dii Yesu na bulu, adoa pongono ko apeaka kilo dji malasi bokimana tuku djisato maputoanedja bo na mile ko na aloesi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nikodɛmɛ na bulu: boindja 3, 1-2. Aloasi: bole bomɔti bo so e malasi, bokɔɔmɔ na mole momɔti imua bosopeaka Bayudha ta epasa e esendja ekanange bo ta pola eyena ekadinge bo ebembe boso bo boisa ta ikila.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ibo basusu babae batomba ebembe e Yesu bahua na bipasa bi bisendja, basopea ebembe mosula mo malasi, bobwana na momɛsɛno mo Bayudha ehole ekapusee bo bibembe bi bobo. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ta esika ebakaka bo Yesu ta ekulusu, gbie emɔti edaka ena, ko ta gbie emina ikila imɔti di yeene idaka ena ko baipaka pusea nongo moto omɔti. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />A bo edaka ta busa bo Mosɛlingo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Mat 27, 62 ko na nase.</char></note> mo sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 19, 31</char></note> ko ikila dimina idaka mbuti, basambea Yesu ena.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bosisoa bo Yesu ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mal 16, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ta isu di boso di eyenga na ihindihindi, Malia o ngando e Magadala akɛɛ ta ikila. Aɛnɛ ibanga didongi ta monɔkɔ mo ikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Iboa apota ebango, akɛɛ ta dii Simona Petelo ko na motingami iyona okina, iyona opalaka Yesu, ko abala na bu ibo: «Badongedji Kumu ta ikila di nde, ko lotadjebakadea esika esamoisa ibo.» <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petelo na motingami iyona okina baimana ko bakɛɛ ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Ibo basusu babae bapotaka ebango; endelo motingami iyona okina anɔɔ Petelo na ebango ko aimea ta ikila boso. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Asumana bɛngi aindje ko aɛnɛ bipasa bi bisendja bisambi ta kpɔtɔ, endelo aikwea ta otei. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simona Petelo iyona omokimanaka, aimea ende engbanga ko aso akwea ta tei e ikila. Aɛnɛ bipasa bi bisendja bisambi ta kpɔtɔ <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ko na epasa e esendja pongono edingaka ibo ta molo mo Yesu; epasa emina e esendja iidaka esika emɔti na bipasa bi bisendja ibia bikina, endelo edingamaka dɔɔngɔ dikina. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Iboa motingami okina, iyona oimeaka boso ta ikila, akwea pongono. Aɛnɛ ko aso adhima. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Iyana boa, mbunoko ta ehole iyena batingami baipaka sipoa Ikomi dii dibala bo Yesu atungi bosisoa ta ndanda e bato bago<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja Ndjem 16, 10.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, batingami ibia babae baso basɔmbɔ ta dii ibo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asainedji na Malia o Magadala</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28, 9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mal 16, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Malia aemaka ta sokolu mbuti na ikila ko ayeaka bio. Ehole eyeaka iyo, asumana bɛngi aindje ta ikila; <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />aso aɛnɛ babwɛndi babae balwali bisendja bipu badii ta esika esamaka ebembe e Yesu boso, omɔti ta pamba e molo, okina ta pamba e mako. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Bandjelu bamowadja bo: «Eyeakadea wɛ nde?» Abasɔmbedja bo: «Badongedji Kumu o mbi, ko natadjebakadea esika emoisi bo.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Asamayo bala iboa, asahombedja ko aɛnɛ Yesu aɛmaka ena, endelo aidjebaka bo edii Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu amowadja bo: «Eyeakadea wɛ nde? Ohombakadea wɛ nda?» Alɛnɛkɛ bo iyo adii moswa gbie, na tina emina abala na nde bo: «Ekadaa wɛ moto omodongedji, tɔndeani esika emoisi wɛ, ko nakɛdea amotomba.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Malia!» Asahombedja dɔɔngɔ dinde ko abala na monɔkɔ mo Baebele bo: «Labuni!» Etingodjakadea bo: «Molehi». <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Pɛpɛ bobandani, modjɔ mo naiweakini ta dii Sesa. Endelo kɛɛ abale na bangi mbi bo, naiweadea ta dii Sesa odii pongono Sangwanu, ta dii Ndjakomba o mbi odii pongono Ndjakomba o bino.» <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Iboa, Malia o ngando e Magadala akɛɛ adii batingami ko abatɔndea bo: «Mbi naɛni Kumu.» Ko abatubana midjɔ mimobaleaka iyo.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aimanei batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Boindja pongono a <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mal 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Okota mɔkɔmɔkɔ mo busa bomina bodaaka bo boso bo eyenga, batingami baputoanaka ta ndako emɔti iboa. Badipaka ekuke na pongola, modjɔ mo babangaka bakondji ba Bayudha. Yesu adoa ko aema ta ndanda e bobo, abala na bu bo: «Bogo bodae na nu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ama yo bala iboa, abainedja mɔmɔ mande na pandje dji nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edii tina e bihuli bi bobakama ta ekulusu ko na boindea ikɔngɔ (boindja 19, 34).</char></note>. Batingami baluma na sepi iyana aɛnɛɛ bo Kumu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu abala na bu na ikina bo: «bogo bodae na nu! Oko mondumba molomani Sesa, mbi pongono naolomakadeani.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ngɔngɔ dji mɛko mimina, abahueya mohuli ko abala bo: «Asɔɔni Mwembo Mosɛnɔke! <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Bato ibia bayɛɛbi ino pekato dji bobo badiabi ekutubanedji e pekato; ta dii ibia balonabi ino bobayɛɛ batadiabi ekutubanedji e pekato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Mat 16, 19; 18, 18.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Enakoboa, Toma, omɔti ta tei batingami doomi na babae, obeamaka na kombe e Ipasa aidaka na bu engbanga ta ehole edoa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Batingami ibi bakina babala na nde bo: «Iso loɛni Kumu!» Endelo Toma abasɔmbedja ibo: «Mbi namiti ɛnɛ bihuli bi sɛtɛ ta mɔmɔ mande, ko namiti isa mosapi mombi ta ipese di sɛtɛ, ko mɔmɔ ma mbi ta mopandje mo nde, nitadhimadea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 20, 20 ko na nase.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ngɔngɔ dji masu bomwambe, batingami ba Yesu baputoana naikina ta ndako, ko Toma adaaka engbanga na bu. Bikuke bidipamaka na pongola, endelo Yesu adoa ko aema ta ndanda e bobo, abala bo: «Bogo bodae na nu.» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Iboa abala na Toma bo: «Isa mosapi mo wɛ iya ko indja mɔmɔ ma mbi; linda ebɔ ewɛ ko isa ta mopandje mo mbi. Kina boboma kitɛ ko dhima!» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu o mbi ko Ndjakomba o mbi!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu abala na nde bo: «Wɛ odhimi tina e bo oɛnini na miso? Mongandi ta dii bato ibia bakadhime na pɛpɛ nongo boɛnɛ na miso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 1Pi 1, 8.</char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina e buku iye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu akɔɔ bimbete bikina binɛnɛ bi bokamodja ta boso bo batingami bande, bidii pɛpɛ boda ta mokanda imu. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Endelo imi misusu mikomami iya bɛngi odhimeni bo Yesu adii Masiya, Mwana o Ndjakomba. Ko na ndjea e edhimeli emina, odiabini bomɔ na kombe e nde.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aimanei batingami sambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu aimanea na ikina ta dii batingami ta mokula mo ibeke di Tibeliade. Indja mondumba mo iyo na baimanea yo: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simona Petelo, Toma obeaka bo Ipasa, Natanaɛlɛ odaaka o Kana ta Galileya, bana baami ba Djebede, ko na batingami bakina babae, badaaka na bu engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simona Petelo abala na bu bo: «Mbi nakɛi a pɛsɛlɛ.» Ibo babala nande bo: «Iso, lokɛkɛ nawɛ pongono.» Iboa bakɛɛ, ko baso batitea ta bwato. Endelo baiowa nongo eka emɔti ta bulu bomina. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ehole ebanga busa bohoa, Yesu aemaka ena ta mokula, endelo batingami baidjebaka bo edaka iyo. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Iboa Yesu abala na bu bo: «Bana ba mba, oowoini swi?» Bamosɔmbedja bo: «Ngasa». <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Abala na bu bo: «Dumbani modjanga ta dɔngɔ di ebɔ e baami e bwato ko odiadeani.» Iboa baso badumba modjanga, ko baihɔnɔ bomotuba ta madiba, elɔkɔ e bo molumaka na swi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ milɔngɔ. 3 ko 6 ko Luk 5, 4-7.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Motingami iyona opalaka Yesu abala na Petelo bo: «Edii Kumu!» Ehole eoka Simona Petelo bo: «Edii Kumu», atomba esendja ende e diko aedinga ta bongo, modjɔ mo aeiwaka bɛngi asɔle, ko asasaba ta madiba. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Batingami bakina babuki badoa na bwato, atuba modjanga imua molumaka na swi: baidaka bohali na mokula, mbuti na mɛtɛlɛ mokama. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ehole eduboa bo o ngondo, batanea mosa molanedjake na swi o diko, ko na mwɛmbɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Doani na ndambo ekina e swi ta ibia basaowa ino.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simona Petelo atitea ta bwato ko atuba modjanga o ngondo molumake na swi banɛnɛnɛnɛ: swi basusu badaaka mokama na tuku itano na basato. Nongo ko ataa swi banɛnɛ, modjanga moialeana. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu abala na bu bo: «Doa ayakeni.» Pɛpɛ nongo motingami omɔti omeka bomowadja bo: «Wɛ nda?», modjɔ mo badjebaka bo edaka Kumu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu abatama, atomba mwɛmbɛ ko abakabanea; abapa pongono swi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Edaka mbala e basato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 20, 19, 26.</char></note> esainedja Yesu adii batingami bande, donga ehole esisoa yo ta tei e bato bago.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Petelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ngɔngɔ dji boyaka, Yesu awadja Simona Petelo bo: «Simona, mwana o moomi o Yoane, okapaleni bonɔɔ ibi basusu?» Amosɔmbedja bo: «Oko boa, Kumu, odjebakadea bo mbi nakaopale.» Yesu abala na nde bo: «Banea bana ba mbi ba bhata.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Ko amowadja mbala e babae: «Simona, mwana moomi o Yoane, okapaleni?» Amosɔmbedja bo: «Oko boa, Kumu, odjebakadea bo mbi nakaopale.» Yesu abala na nde bo: «Banea bhata ba mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Ko amowadja naikina mbala e basato: «Simona, mwana moomi o Yoane, okapaleni?» Petelo aoka ndjokwa ta modjɔ momowadja Yesu ta mbala e basato bo: «Okapaleni?», ko amosɔmbedja bo: «Kumu, wɛ odjebakadea midjɔ misusu; odjebakadea bonie mbi nakaopale!» Yesu abala na nde bo: «Banea bhata ba mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ Bik 20, 28; 1 Pi 5, 2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Oko boa naotɔndeakadea, sooti mɛnɛ bo: ehole edaka wɛ mondjenga, otingeaka wɛ mɛnɛ mosenge mo wɛ mo esendja ko okɛkɛ ta esika esusu epalaka wɛ; endelo ehole eimeadea wɛ mosuku, oninodjadea mɔmɔ, moto okina atingeadea mosenge mo wɛ ko aotombadea ta polo edaadea wɛ pɛpɛ bopala bokɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Ta mibalo mimina imia, Yesu ainedjaka mondumba ndani mogwabi Petelo ko na bopa ekumu ta dii Ndjakomba. Ngɔngɔ djimina, Yesu abala na nde bo: «Kimanani.»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na motingami opalaka iyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petelo ahombana ko aso aɛnɛ ngɔngɔ dji bobo motingami iyona opalaka Yesu, iyona okukamaka ta bupa bo Yesu ehole eyakaka ibo ko awadjaka Yesu bo: «Kumu, iyona omina ookabadea nda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boindja 13, 25.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petelo amoɛnɛ ko awadja Yesu bo: «Kumu, iboa iyo modadea na nde bo?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu amosɔmbedja bo: «Mbi nakapala bonie iyo ayeyoe tee mbunoko nakasɔmbɔ, moindji wɛ? Wɛ, kimanani!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Gala emina enangana ta tei e badhimi bo motingami omina atagwabi. Enakoboa Yesu aibala na Petelo bo: «Atagwabi», endelo abalaka na nde bo: «Mbi nakapala bonie iyo ayeyoe tee mbunoko nakasɔmbɔ, moindji wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Edii oko motingami omina obalakadea tati e mɛko mimina imia ko amiisi ta mokanda, ko iso lodjebakadea bo tati e nde edii e sooti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 19, 35.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ta bosukedja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesu akɔɔ midjɔ mikina mibuki minɛnɛ. Ekadaa bo lotubane modjɔ momɔti na momɔti ta mokanda, nalɛdjɛkɛdea bo ngondo mobimba ebwaniti bodia buku djikomadea iso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boɛngɛ 20, 30. </char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>